{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015VxaDAKvYCAoF2L6JxntQs","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"LoRA Expert Training — 3 Specialized + 1 Universal\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"Train 4 LoRA adapters (rank 16, Q/K/V/O on all 18 PaliGemma layers, 3.7M params each): LoRA-V (online visual augmentation), LoRA-S (oracle spatial demos), LoRA-P (oracle physical demos), Universal (mixed all-perturbation data). Evaluate each expert on its matched type AND cross-type.\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"lora_v_on_visual\": 80.2,\n7\t      \"lora_v_on_spatial\": 62.0,\n8\t      \"lora_v_on_physical\": 60.2,\n9\t      \"lora_s_on_visual\": 59.5,\n10\t      \"lora_s_on_spatial\": 77.5,\n11\t      \"lora_s_on_physical\": 60.0,\n12\t      \"lora_p_on_visual\": 58.2,\n13\t      \"lora_p_on_spatial\": 60.8,\n14\t      \"lora_p_on_physical\": 74.8,\n15\t      \"universal_r16_visual\": 64.8,\n16\t      \"universal_r16_spatial\": 60.5,\n17\t      \"universal_r16_physical\": 58.2,\n18\t      \"universal_r16_overall\": 62.4,\n19\t      \"cross_type_avg_drop_pp\": 17.4,\n20\t      \"val_action_mse_lora_v\": 0.0082,\n21\t      \"val_action_mse_lora_s\": 0.0091,\n22\t      \"val_action_mse_lora_p\": 0.0098,\n23\t      \"val_action_mse_universal\": 0.0105,\n24\t      \"convergence_epochs\": 15\n25\t    },\n26\t    \"tables\": [\n27\t      {\n28\t        \"name\": \"Cross-type evaluation matrix\",\n29\t        \"description\": \"3×3 expert-vs-type matrix + universal 行。对角线显著高于非对角线 （avg drop 17.4pp），验证修正不可互换。\\n\",\n30\t        \"data\": {\n31\t          \"headers\": [\n32\t            \"Expert \\\\ Type\",\n33\t            \"Visual (%)\",\n34\t            \"Spatial (%)\",\n35\t            \"Physical (%)\"\n36\t          ],\n37\t          \"rows\": [\n38\t            [\n39\t              \"LoRA-V\",\n40\t              \"80.2 ★\",\n41\t              \"62.0\",\n42\t              \"60.2\"\n43\t            ],\n44\t            [\n45\t              \"LoRA-S\",\n46\t              \"59.5\",\n47\t              \"77.5 ★\",\n48\t              \"60.0\"\n49\t            ],\n50\t            [\n51\t              \"LoRA-P\",\n52\t              \"58.2\",\n53\t              \"60.8\",\n54\t              \"74.8 ★\"\n55\t            ],\n56\t            [\n57\t              \"Universal-r16\",\n58\t              \"64.8\",\n59\t              \"60.5\",\n60\t              \"58.2\"\n61\t            ],\n62\t            [\n63\t              \"Frozen pi0\",\n64\t              \"50.8\",\n65\t              \"57.5\",\n66\t              \"56.2\"\n67\t            ]\n68\t          ]\n69\t        }\n70\t      }\n71\t    ],\n72\t    \"figures\": [],\n73\t    \"analysis\": \"Cross-type drop 全部 >15pp（最小 15.3pp for LoRA-P on spatial，最大 19.1pp for LoRA-V on spatial/physical avg），直接验证 Claim 2 的前提假设。Universal LoRA 在所有类型上都不如对应的 matched expert（差距 12-17pp），确立了 routing 的必要性。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，perturbation-specific LoRA 学到了质性不同的修正模式。LoRA-V 在 视觉扰动上达到 80.2%（+29.4pp over frozen），因为在线增强（camera jitter, brightness shift, background swap, Gaussian noise）精确匹配 LIBERO-Plus 视觉 扰动分布，LoRA 只需学习 early-layer visual representation 的低秩修正。LoRA-S 和 LoRA-P 在各自类型上分别达到 77.5%/74.8%，略低于 LoRA-V，原因有二：(1) spatial 和 physical 的 oracle demo 采集本身引入采集噪声；(2) 空间和物理扰动涉及 action-level 的高层语义调整，比纯视觉修正的 representation 变换更复杂。 关键证据在 cross-type performance：LoRA-V 在 spatial 上仅 62.0%（drop 18.2pp）， 因为视觉修正无法纠正 layout 引起的 action trajectory 偏移——这两种修正在 representation space 中方向正交。LoRA-P 在 visual 上仅 58.2%（drop 16.6pp）， 因为力学修正作用于 late-layer action planning，反而干扰了本该保持的 early-layer visual features。cross-type 仍高于 frozen（58-62% vs 50-57%），说明 experts 学到了部分可迁移的通用 robustness（如 LoRA 的低秩约束本身有 regularization 效果）， 但 type-specific 部分不可互换。Universal LoRA 在各类型上均为中等水平（58-65%）， 是典型的 jack-of-all-trades：3.7M 参数被迫在三种修正方向之间妥协， 每个方向分到的有效容量不足以匹配专有 expert。Val MSE 证实了这一点：专有 expert （0.008-0.010）显著低于 universal（0.0105），说明 specialization 带来更精确的 action prediction。\\n\"\n74\t  },\n75\t  {\n76\t    \"name\": \"Meta-Brain Assembly — PAR Router + LoRA Bank E2E\",\n77\t    \"description\": \"组装 PAR router (PaliGemma layer 6, 2-layer MLP, first-token pooling) + 3 LoRA experts，soft routing: h_corrected = h_frozen + Σ_k p(type_k)·LoRA_k(h_frozen)。 冻结 LoRA 参数，仅微调 PAR routing weights。全 LIBERO-Plus benchmark 评估。\\n\",\n78\t    \"results\": {\n79\t      \"libero_plus_overall\": 78.9,\n80\t      \"libero_plus_std\": 1.2,\n81\t      \"per_type_visual\": 81.2,\n82\t      \"per_type_spatial\": 77.5,\n83\t      \"per_type_physical\": 74.8,\n84\t      \"per_subtype_camera\": 78.5,\n85\t      \"per_subtype_light\": 83.8,\n86\t      \"per_subtype_background\": 80.2,\n87\t      \"per_subtype_noise\": 82.1,\n88\t      \"per_subtype_layout\": 77.5,\n89\t      \"per_subtype_robot\": 74.8,\n90\t      \"routing_weight_visual_on_lora_v\": 0.91,\n91\t      \"routing_weight_spatial_on_lora_s\": 0.88,\n92\t      \"routing_weight_physical_on_lora_p\": 0.86,\n93\t      \"routing_entropy_visual\": 0.12,\n94\t      \"routing_entropy_spatial\": 0.15,\n95\t      \"routing_entropy_physical\": 0.18,\n96\t      \"par_routing_accuracy\": 96.8,\n97\t      \"e2e_finetuning_epochs\": 5,\n98\t      \"total_trainable_params_M\": 11.6\n99\t    },\n100\t    \"tables\": [\n101\t      {\n102\t        \"name\": \"LIBERO-Plus per-perturbation breakdown\",\n103\t        \"data\": {\n104\t          \"headers\": [\n105\t            \"Perturbation\",\n106\t            \"Type\",\n107\t            \"Success (%)\",\n108\t            \"Δ Frozen (pp)\",\n109\t            \"Routing Weight\"\n110\t          ],\n111\t          \"rows\": [\n112\t            [\n113\t              \"Camera\",\n114\t              \"Visual\",\n115\t              \"78.5\",\n116\t              \"+30.3\",\n117\t              \"LoRA-V: 0.92\"\n118\t            ],\n119\t            [\n120\t              \"Light\",\n121\t              \"Visual\",\n122\t              \"83.8\",\n123\t              \"+31.3\",\n124\t              \"LoRA-V: 0.93\"\n125\t            ],\n126\t            [\n127\t              \"Background\",\n128\t              \"Visual\",\n129\t              \"80.2\",\n130\t              \"+29.4\",\n131\t              \"LoRA-V: 0.90\"\n132\t            ],\n133\t            [\n134\t              \"Noise\",\n135\t              \"Visual\",\n136\t              \"82.1\",\n137\t              \"+28.9\",\n138\t              \"LoRA-V: 0.89\"\n139\t            ],\n140\t            [\n141\t              \"Layout\",\n142\t              \"Spatial\",\n143\t              \"77.5\",\n144\t              \"+20.0\",\n145\t              \"LoRA-S: 0.88\"\n146\t            ],\n147\t            [\n148\t              \"Robot\",\n149\t              \"Physical\",\n150\t              \"74.8\",\n151\t              \"+18.6\",\n152\t              \"LoRA-P: 0.86\"\n153\t            ],\n154\t            [\n155\t              \"Overall\",\n156\t              \"—\",\n157\t              \"78.9\",\n158\t              \"+25.3\",\n159\t              \"—\"\n160\t            ]\n161\t          ]\n162\t        }\n163\t      }\n164\t    ],\n165\t    \"figures\": [],\n166\t    \"analysis\": \"78.9% overall + near-diagonal routing weights + 96.8% routing accuracy 共同 构成 best 档核心证据。routing entropy 的 per-type 差异（0.12 visual vs 0.18 physical）反映了 Phase 0 分类精度的差异——但即使 physical 的 entropy 也远低于 maximum（0.18 vs log(3)=1.10），确认所有类型的 routing 都高度确定。\\n\\n\\n78.9% 整体成功率来自三个因素的协同：(1) PAR router routing accuracy 达 96.8%—— Phase 0 已证明 layer 6 first-token 激活在 3-class 上 F1=1.0，端到端微调只需 轻微校准 soft routing 的温度参数；(2) soft routing entropy 极低（0.12-0.18）， 说明 router 对每种扰动类型高度确信，routing weights 近似 one-hot（视觉扰动时 LoRA-V 权重 0.91），使 Meta-Brain 在运行时近似 oracle routing——这直接解释了 oracle gap 仅 1.8pp；(3) 各 expert 本身质量高（plan_002 验证），routing 只需 选对 expert 即可。per-type 排序 V>S>P（81.2>77.5>74.8）反映了扰动修正的内在 难度梯度：视觉扰动是最规则的低秩变换（brightness/contrast 近似线性），空间扰动 需要调整 mid-level spatial reasoning，物理扰动涉及 action planning 的高层语义 重构。per-subtype 中 light 最高（83.8%）因为亮度变化是最平滑的视觉扰动， camera 稍低（78.5%）因为视角变化需要更复杂的几何 re-projection。Physical expert 的 routing confidence 稍低（0.86 vs 0.91）因为物理扰动在激活空间中的 cluster 略松散（Phase 0: physical F1=0.951 at K=1 vs spatial F1=1.0）。\\n\"\n167\t  },\n168\t  {\n169\t    \"name\": \"Oracle Routing Ablation\",\n170\t    \"description\": \"用 ground-truth 扰动类型标签（hard one-hot）替换 PAR router，测量 learned routing 与 perfect routing 的上界差距。\\n\",\n171\t    \"results\": {\n172\t      \"oracle_overall\": 80.7,\n173\t      \"oracle_std\": 0.9,\n174\t      \"oracle_visual\": 83.0,\n175\t      \"oracle_spatial\": 79.2,\n176\t      \"oracle_physical\": 76.5,\n177\t      \"oracle_minus_meta_brain_overall\": 1.8,\n178\t      \"oracle_minus_meta_brain_visual\": 1.8,\n179\t      \"oracle_minus_meta_brain_spatial\": 1.7,\n180\t      \"oracle_minus_meta_brain_physical\": 1.7\n181\t    },\n182\t    \"tables\": [],\n183\t    \"figures\": [],\n184\t    \"analysis\": \"1.8pp gap 证明 PAR router 不是系统瓶颈。未来提升应聚焦于 expert 质量 （更好训练数据、更高 rank）而非 router 改进。Oracle 结果也为 routing 设定了 performance ceiling：~80.7% 是 rank-16 expert bank 的理论上限。\\n\\n\\nOracle routing 达到 80.7%，仅比 Meta-Brain（78.9%）高 1.8pp。Gap 小于 routing 分类错误率所预测的值（routing accuracy 96.8% → 3.2% 错误 → 预期 impact ~3pp）， 因为 PAR 的 soft routing 在分类不完全正确时仍分配了较高权重给正确 expert （如 misrouted visual 案例中 LoRA-V 仍获 0.65 权重 vs LoRA-S 0.35），使得 routing error 的 downstream impact 被 dampen。per-type gap 高度一致 （1.7-1.8pp），说明 PAR router 在三种类型上的性能均衡，没有系统性偏向。 Physical 的 oracle gap（1.7pp）最小，看似反直觉（physical 的 routing accuracy 最低），但 physical expert 的 cross-type performance（60.0-60.8%）高于其他 expert 的 cross-type（58.2-62.0%），使得 misrouting 的惩罚较轻。\\n\"\n185\t  },\n186\t  {\n187\t    \"name\": \"Ablation Ladder — Full Systematic Comparison\",\n188\t    \"description\": \"LIBERO-Plus 上 6 个系统配置的系统对比（5 seeds）：Frozen → Universal-r16 → Universal-r48 → Random Routing → Meta-Brain → Oracle。包含 rank-48 parameter-matched control 和 random routing baseline。\\n\",\n189\t    \"results\": {\n190\t      \"frozen_pi0_overall\": 53.6,\n191\t      \"frozen_pi0_std\": 0.8,\n192\t      \"universal_r16_overall\": 62.4,\n193\t      \"universal_r16_std\": 1.4,\n194\t      \"universal_r48_overall\": 65.1,\n195\t      \"universal_r48_std\": 1.3,\n196\t      \"random_routing_overall\": 65.8,\n197\t      \"random_routing_std\": 2.1,\n198\t      \"meta_brain_overall\": 78.9,\n199\t      \"meta_brain_std\": 1.2,\n200\t      \"oracle_routing_overall\": 80.7,\n201\t      \"oracle_routing_std\": 0.9,\n202\t      \"step_frozen_to_r16\": 8.8,\n203\t      \"step_r16_to_r48\": 2.7,\n204\t      \"step_r48_to_random\": 0.7,\n205\t      \"step_random_to_meta_brain\": 13.1,\n206\t      \"step_meta_brain_to_oracle\": 1.8,\n207\t      \"routing_gap_vs_rank48\": 13.8,\n208\t      \"routing_gap_vs_random\": 13.1,\n209\t      \"random_vs_r48_pvalue\": 0.38,\n210\t      \"meta_brain_vs_random_pvalue\": 3e-05,\n211\t      \"meta_brain_vs_r48_pvalue\": 1e-05,\n212\t      \"per_type_visual_frozen\": 50.8,\n213\t      \"per_type_spatial_frozen\": 57.5,\n214\t      \"per_type_physical_frozen\": 56.2,\n215\t      \"per_type_visual_r48\": 67.5,\n216\t      \"per_type_spatial_r48\": 63.2,\n217\t      \"per_type_physical_r48\": 60.8,\n218\t      \"per_type_visual_random\": 66.8,\n219\t      \"per_type_spatial_random\": 65.5,\n220\t      \"per_type_physical_random\": 63.2\n221\t    },\n222\t    \"tables\": [\n223\t      {\n224\t        \"name\": \"Ablation Ladder — Main Results (5 seeds)\",\n225\t        \"data\": {\n226\t          \"headers\": [\n227\t            \"Method\",\n228\t            \"Params\",\n229\t            \"Overall (%)\",\n230\t            \"Visual (%)\",\n231\t            \"Spatial (%)\",\n232\t            \"Physical (%)\",\n233\t            \"Δ Frozen\"\n234\t          ],\n235\t          \"rows\": [\n236\t            [\n237\t              \"Frozen pi0\",\n238\t              \"0\",\n239\t              \"53.6 ± 0.8\",\n240\t              \"50.8\",\n241\t              \"57.5\",\n242\t              \"56.2\",\n243\t              \"—\"\n244\t            ],\n245\t            [\n246\t              \"Universal r16\",\n247\t              \"3.7M\",\n248\t              \"62.4 ± 1.4\",\n249\t              \"64.8\",\n250\t              \"60.5\",\n251\t              \"58.2\",\n252\t              \"+8.8\"\n253\t            ],\n254\t            [\n255\t              \"Universal r48\",\n256\t              \"12M\",\n257\t              \"65.1 ± 1.3\",\n258\t              \"67.5\",\n259\t              \"63.2\",\n260\t              \"60.8\",\n261\t              \"+11.5\"\n262\t            ],\n263\t            [\n264\t              \"Random Routing\",\n265\t              \"12M\",\n266\t              \"65.8 ± 2.1\",\n267\t              \"66.8\",\n268\t              \"65.5\",\n269\t              \"63.2\",\n270\t              \"+12.2\"\n271\t            ],\n272\t            [\n273\t              \"Meta-Brain (ours)\",\n274\t              \"12M\",\n275\t              \"78.9 ± 1.2\",\n276\t              \"81.2\",\n277\t              \"77.5\",\n278\t              \"74.8\",\n279\t              \"+25.3\"\n280\t            ],\n281\t            [\n282\t              \"Oracle Routing\",\n283\t              \"12M\",\n284\t              \"80.7 ± 0.9\",\n285\t              \"83.0\",\n286\t              \"79.2\",\n287\t              \"76.5\",\n288\t              \"+27.1\"\n289\t            ]\n290\t          ]\n291\t        }\n292\t      },\n293\t      {\n294\t        \"name\": \"Statistical significance\",\n295\t        \"data\": {\n296\t          \"headers\": [\n297\t            \"Comparison\",\n298\t            \"Gap (pp)\",\n299\t            \"p-value\",\n300\t            \"Significant?\"\n301\t          ],\n302\t          \"rows\": [\n303\t            [\n304\t              \"Meta-Brain vs r48\",\n305\t              \"13.8\",\n306\t              \"<0.001\",\n307\t              \"Yes (***)\"\n308\t            ],\n309\t            [\n310\t              \"Meta-Brain vs Random\",\n311\t              \"13.1\",\n312\t              \"<0.001\",\n313\t              \"Yes (***)\"\n314\t            ],\n315\t            [\n316\t              \"Random vs r48\",\n317\t              \"0.7\",\n318\t              \"0.38\",\n319\t              \"No (n.s.)\"\n320\t            ],\n321\t            [\n322\t              \"Oracle vs Meta-Brain\",\n323\t              \"1.8\",\n324\t              \"0.03\",\n325\t              \"Yes (*)\"\n326\t            ]\n327\t          ]\n328\t        }\n329\t      }\n330\t    ],\n331\t    \"figures\": [],\n332\t    \"analysis\": \"消融梯度提供三个推论：(a) routing >> ensemble（13.1pp vs 0.7pp, ratio 18.7×）； (b) routing >> capacity scaling（13.8pp vs 2.7pp, ratio 5.1×）； (c) PAR ≈ oracle（gap 1.8pp）。Random vs r48 的 null result（p=0.38）是 全文最关键的 negative finding——它排除了 Claim 2 的唯一 alternative explanation。\\n\\n\\n消融梯度严格单调递增（53.6→62.4→65.1→65.8→78.9→80.7），每一步对应一个 独立的能力维度： (1) Frozen→r16（+8.8pp）：LoRA 本身提供了通用的 representation correction 能力， 即使不区分扰动类型，低秩修正也能改善 feature robustness。 (2) r16→r48（+2.7pp）：增加 rank 有帮助但收益递减——3.2× 参数仅换来 2.7pp， 说明 universal correction 的 capacity utilization efficiency 随 rank 下降， 因为额外参数被迫在三种互斥修正方向上妥协。 (3) r48→Random（+0.7pp, p=0.38 不显著）：仅 3 个 expert 的 ensemble 效应 几乎不存在。Random routing 有时碰巧选对 expert（1/3 概率），拉高了均值， 但也有 2/3 概率选错并导致 suboptimal correction。这两个效应近似抵消， 使 random 仅比 universal 高 0.7pp。p=0.38 的不显著性是关键 null result—— 它排除了 \\\"Meta-Brain 的好处来自 ensemble averaging\\\" 的 alternative explanation。 (4) Random→Meta-Brain（+13.1pp, p<0.001）：整个梯度中最大的单步跳跃。 精确 routing 带来的提升远超 capacity scaling（2.7pp）和 ensemble（0.7pp）的 总和——routing 的边际贡献（13.1pp）是 capacity scaling（2.7pp）的 4.9×。 这是 Claim 2 的核心量化证据。 (5) Meta-Brain→Oracle（+1.8pp）：PAR router 接近理论上限。 Random routing 的高 std（2.1 vs Meta-Brain 的 1.2）反映了随机 expert 分配的 天然不稳定性——在某些 seed 下碰巧匹配较多，在其他 seed 下则严重不匹配。\\n\"\n333\t  },\n334\t  {\n335\t    \"name\": \"FTM/FLA Reproduction — Visual-Only Baseline\",\n336\t    \"description\": \"在 pi0 backbone 上复现 FTM（Fine-Tuning Masking），对比 FTM vs Meta-Brain 在视觉扰动上的表现，并展示 Meta-Brain 在 spatial/physical 上的独特优势。\\n\",\n337\t    \"results\": {\n338\t      \"ftm_visual_avg\": 75.7,\n339\t      \"ftm_camera\": 73.2,\n340\t      \"ftm_light\": 78.5,\n341\t      \"ftm_background\": 74.8,\n342\t      \"ftm_noise\": 76.2,\n343\t      \"ftm_spatial\": 55.8,\n344\t      \"ftm_physical\": 54.5,\n345\t      \"ftm_overall\": 65.2,\n346\t      \"ftm_params_K\": 4,\n347\t      \"meta_brain_vs_ftm_visual_gap\": 5.5,\n348\t      \"meta_brain_vs_ftm_spatial_gap\": 21.7,\n349\t      \"meta_brain_vs_ftm_physical_gap\": 20.3\n350\t    },\n351\t    \"tables\": [\n352\t      {\n353\t        \"name\": \"FTM vs Meta-Brain comparison\",\n354\t        \"data\": {\n355\t          \"headers\": [\n356\t            \"Method\",\n357\t            \"Params\",\n358\t            \"Visual (%)\",\n359\t            \"Spatial (%)\",\n360\t            \"Physical (%)\",\n361\t            \"Overall (%)\"\n362\t          ],\n363\t          \"rows\": [\n364\t            [\n365\t              \"Frozen pi0\",\n366\t              \"0\",\n367\t              \"50.8\",\n368\t              \"57.5\",\n369\t              \"56.2\",\n370\t              \"53.6\"\n371\t            ],\n372\t            [\n373\t              \"FTM (reprod.)\",\n374\t              \"4K\",\n375\t              \"75.7\",\n376\t              \"55.8\",\n377\t              \"54.5\",\n378\t              \"65.2\"\n379\t            ],\n380\t            [\n381\t              \"Meta-Brain\",\n382\t              \"12M\",\n383\t              \"81.2\",\n384\t              \"77.5\",\n385\t              \"74.8\",\n386\t              \"78.9\"\n387\t            ]\n388\t          ]\n389\t        }\n390\t      }\n391\t    ],\n392\t    \"figures\": [],\n393\t    \"analysis\": \"FTM 是 visual-only robustness 的 strong baseline，且参数效率极高。论文中应定位为 \\\"single-modality approach 的代表\\\"——它证明了 visual 修正可以极其高效， 但也证明了 single-modality 无法推广到 multi-type perturbation 场景。 Meta-Brain 即使在 visual-only 上也优于 FTM（+5.5pp），说明 LoRA-based correction 比 feature masking 更有表达力。\\n\\n\\nFTM 在 pi0 上复现后视觉扰动达 75.7%（+24.9pp over frozen），以极少参数（4K） 实现了可观修正，验证了 FTM 的 feature masking 原理在 pi0 上同样有效—— masking 通过抑制 early-layer 中被扰动 corrupted 的 feature channel 来恢复 clean representation。但 FTM 在 spatial（55.8%）和 physical（54.5%）上等同于 frozen baseline 甚至略低（spatial -1.7pp），因为 FTM 的核心假设是扰动破坏 视觉特征——对 layout 变化或机器人初始状态变化，masking visual channels 不仅 无益反而可能抑制有用的 spatial/physical 信号。Meta-Brain 在视觉扰动上也高于 FTM（81.2% vs 75.7%，+5.5pp），因为 rank-16 LoRA（3.7M params）比 feature masking（4K params）有更大的修正表达能力——LoRA 可以 rotate 和 scale 整个 subspace，而 masking 只能 zero-out channels。但 FTM 的极高参数效率 （4K params for +24.9pp on visual）使其在 visual-only 场景下仍然有独特价值。 核心对比：Meta-Brain 在 spatial/physical 上分别高出 FTM 21.7pp 和 20.3pp， 这正是 multi-type routing 的 unique value proposition。\\n\"\n394\t  },\n395\t  {\n396\t    \"name\": \"Parameter Efficiency Analysis\",\n397\t    \"description\": \"计算各方法的 gain-over-frozen-baseline，按可训练参数归一化， 绘制 parameter efficiency scatter plot。纯分析，无 GPU 计算。\\n\",\n398\t    \"results\": {\n399\t      \"meta_brain_gain_pp\": 25.3,\n400\t      \"meta_brain_params_M\": 12,\n401\t      \"meta_brain_gain_per_M\": 2.11,\n402\t      \"universal_r16_gain_pp\": 8.8,\n403\t      \"universal_r16_params_M\": 3.7,\n404\t      \"universal_r16_gain_per_M\": 2.38,\n405\t      \"universal_r48_gain_pp\": 11.5,\n406\t      \"universal_r48_params_M\": 12,\n407\t      \"universal_r48_gain_per_M\": 0.96,\n408\t      \"ftm_gain_visual_pp\": 24.9,\n409\t      \"ftm_gain_overall_pp\": 11.6,\n410\t      \"ftm_params_M\": 0.004,\n411\t      \"ftm_gain_per_M_visual\": 6225.0,\n412\t      \"ftm_gain_per_M_overall\": 2900.0,\n413\t      \"vla_gse_gain_pp\": 12.0,\n414\t      \"vla_gse_params_M\": 114,\n415\t      \"vla_gse_gain_per_M\": 0.105,\n416\t      \"meta_brain_pareto_optimal\": true,\n417\t      \"meta_brain_vs_r48_efficiency_ratio\": 2.2\n418\t    },\n419\t    \"tables\": [\n420\t      {\n421\t        \"name\": \"Parameter efficiency summary\",\n422\t        \"data\": {\n423\t          \"headers\": [\n424\t            \"Method\",\n425\t            \"Backbone\",\n426\t            \"Params\",\n427\t            \"Gain (pp)\",\n428\t            \"Gain/M\",\n429\t            \"Coverage\"\n430\t          ],\n431\t          \"rows\": [\n432\t            [\n433\t              \"FTM\",\n434\t              \"pi0\",\n435\t              \"4K\",\n436\t              \"+24.9 (V) / +11.6 (all)\",\n437\t              \"6225 / 2900\",\n438\t              \"Visual only\"\n439\t            ],\n440\t            [\n441\t              \"Universal r16\",\n442\t              \"pi0\",\n443\t              \"3.7M\",\n444\t              \"+8.8\",\n445\t              \"2.38\",\n446\t              \"All types\"\n447\t            ],\n448\t            [\n449\t              \"Meta-Brain (ours)\",\n450\t              \"pi0\",\n451\t              \"12M\",\n452\t              \"+25.3\",\n453\t              \"2.11\",\n454\t              \"All types\"\n455\t            ],\n456\t            [\n457\t              \"Universal r48\",\n458\t              \"pi0\",\n459\t              \"12M\",\n460\t              \"+11.5\",\n461\t              \"0.96\",\n462\t              \"All types\"\n463\t            ],\n464\t            [\n465\t              \"VLA-GSE †\",\n466\t              \"Qwen3-4B\",\n467\t              \"114M\",\n468\t              \"+12.0\",\n469\t              \"0.105\",\n470\t              \"All types\"\n471\t            ]\n472\t          ]\n473\t        }\n474\t      }\n475\t    ],\n476\t    \"figures\": [],\n477\t    \"analysis\": \"Meta-Brain 是 multi-type robustness 场景下的 Pareto optimal 方法。关键 insight： routing 让同等参数预算（12M）的效率提升 2.2×——这不是 architectural overhead 的代价，而是 capacity allocation strategy 的收益。Parameter efficiency scatter 是 Claim 3 的 primary visual evidence。\\n\\n\\n参数效率分析揭示了三个 regime：(1) 极低参数区（<1M）：FTM 以 4K params 在 visual-only 上达到 gain_per_M=6225，但 overall gain_per_M（2900）反映了它 无法覆盖 non-visual 的局限；(2) 中等参数区（1-15M）：Meta-Brain 占据 Pareto 前沿——12M params, 25.3pp gain, gain_per_M=2.11。同参数量的 Universal-r48 仅 gain_per_M=0.96，效率差 2.2×。这 2.2× 的效率倍数就是 routing 的量化贡献； (3) 高参数区（>100M）：VLA-GSE 的 114M params 仅提供 gain_per_M=0.105 （不同 backbone，仅作 suggestive 对比）。即使考虑 backbone 差异，Meta-Brain 的 gain_per_M（2.11）比 VLA-GSE（0.105）高 20×，数量级差异足以支撑 parameter efficiency narrative。Universal r16 的 gain_per_M（2.38）看似高于 Meta-Brain （2.11），但绝对 gain 仅 8.8pp vs 25.3pp——在 \\\"达到实用性能阈值\\\" 的约束下， r16 的高效率无意义，因为 62.4% 可能低于部署要求。\\n\"\n478\t  },\n479\t  {\n480\t    \"name\": \"Correction Memory Ablation\",\n481\t    \"description\": \"对比 Meta-Brain with/without Correction Memory (CM)，量化 CM 的边际收益。 CM 通过 FAISS 检索相似历史扰动的 routing weight 来调制当前 routing。\\n\",\n482\t    \"results\": {\n483\t      \"meta_brain_no_cm\": 78.9,\n484\t      \"meta_brain_with_cm\": 80.1,\n485\t      \"cm_delta_overall\": 1.2,\n486\t      \"cm_delta_visual\": 0.8,\n487\t      \"cm_delta_spatial\": 1.5,\n488\t      \"cm_delta_physical\": 1.8,\n489\t      \"cm_additional_params\": 1,\n490\t      \"cm_latency_overhead_ms\": 2.3,\n491\t      \"cm_pvalue\": 0.08\n492\t    },\n493\t    \"tables\": [],\n494\t    \"figures\": [],\n495\t    \"analysis\": \"CM 是 optional module，+1.2pp 不改变任何 claim 的结论。论文呈现策略： 一行 ablation 文字 + footnote table，明确标注 \\\"optional, borderline significant\\\"。 Dream reviewers 一致认为 CM 是 padding，降级处理是正确决策。\\n\\n\\nCM 提供 +1.2pp 整体提升（p=0.08, borderline significant with 5 seeds）， 主要来自 spatial（+1.5pp）和 physical（+1.8pp）而非 visual（+0.8pp）。 这符合 CM 的设计逻辑：CM 检索与当前 observation 最相似的历史扰动 exemplar， 用其 routing weight 作为 contextual prior 来调制 PAR 输出。Spatial 和 physical 扰动的 within-type 变异更大（不同 layout randomization 的具体形态差异远大于 不同 lighting condition），历史 exemplar 能提供有用的 \\\"这种具体 layout 变化 应该如何调整 routing\\\" 的信息。Visual 上 CM 收益小因为 PAR 对视觉扰动已经 足够准确（routing accuracy ~98% on visual），contextual modulation 的改进空间 有限。但 +1.2pp 的总收益与 1 个额外可学习参数 + 2.3ms CPU latency 相比， cost-benefit 偏低——不值得作为 named architectural component 推广。\\n\"\n496\t  },\n497\t  {\n498\t    \"name\": \"Router Architecture Comparison\",\n499\t    \"description\": \"对比 3 种 PAR router 变体：2-layer MLP (default), linear classifier, attention-based router。均使用 PaliGemma layer 6 first-token features。\\n\",\n500\t    \"results\": {\n501\t      \"mlp_routing_accuracy\": 96.8,\n502\t      \"mlp_downstream\": 78.9,\n503\t      \"mlp_params_M\": 0.53,\n504\t      \"linear_routing_accuracy\": 94.2,\n505\t      \"linear_downstream\": 76.8,\n506\t      \"linear_params_M\": 0.01,\n507\t      \"attention_routing_accuracy\": 97.1,\n508\t      \"attention_downstream\": 78.5,\n509\t      \"attention_params_M\": 1.85\n510\t    },\n511\t    \"tables\": [\n512\t      {\n513\t        \"name\": \"Router architecture comparison\",\n514\t        \"data\": {\n515\t          \"headers\": [\n516\t            \"Router Type\",\n517\t            \"Params (M)\",\n518\t            \"Routing Acc (%)\",\n519\t            \"Downstream (%)\"\n520\t          ],\n521\t          \"rows\": [\n522\t            [\n523\t              \"Linear\",\n524\t              \"0.01\",\n525\t              \"94.2\",\n526\t              \"76.8\"\n527\t            ],\n528\t            [\n529\t              \"2-layer MLP ★\",\n530\t              \"0.53\",\n531\t              \"96.8\",\n532\t              \"78.9\"\n533\t            ],\n534\t            [\n535\t              \"Attention\",\n536\t              \"1.85\",\n537\t              \"97.1\",\n538\t              \"78.5\"\n539\t            ]\n540\t          ]\n541\t        }\n542\t      }\n543\t    ],\n544\t    \"figures\": [],\n545\t    \"analysis\": \"Router 架构的 downstream impact 有限（max spread 2.1pp），说明 Meta-Brain 的性能主要由 routing 原理和 expert 质量驱动，而非 router 实现细节。 论文中作简短 ablation paragraph 处理。\\n\\n\\nMLP（96.8% routing, 78.9% downstream）是最优 cost-performance 均衡。Linear 分类器准确率低 2.6pp（94.2%），因为 3-class 边界在激活空间中有轻微非线性—— Phase 0 t-SNE 显示 Spatial/Physical cluster 的边界不完全线性可分（两者都 影响 action space，共享部分特征），MLP 的一层隐藏层足以 model 这个非线性。 2.6pp routing gap 转化为 2.1pp downstream gap（76.8% vs 78.9%），说明 routing accuracy 和 task success 近似线性相关但有 damping（soft routing 缓冲了部分 routing error）。Attention-based router routing accuracy 最高 （97.1%），但 downstream 反而略低（78.5%），因为 1.85M 额外参数在仅 5 epoch 微调下轻微 overfit——attention 的表达能力对 3-class routing 过剩。\\n\"\n546\t  },\n547\t  {\n548\t    \"name\": \"6-class vs 3-class Routing\",\n549\t    \"description\": \"对比 6-class 精细路由（camera/light/background/noise/layout/robot 各一个 LoRA expert，6×3.7M=22.1M params）vs 3-class 粗路由（Visual/Spatial/Physical， 3×3.7M=11.1M params）。\\n\",\n550\t    \"results\": {\n551\t      \"3class_overall\": 78.9,\n552\t      \"3class_params_M\": 12,\n553\t      \"6class_overall\": 79.6,\n554\t      \"6class_params_M\": 24,\n555\t      \"6class_delta\": 0.7,\n556\t      \"6class_camera\": 80.2,\n557\t      \"6class_light\": 84.5,\n558\t      \"6class_background\": 81.0,\n559\t      \"6class_noise\": 83.2,\n560\t      \"6class_layout\": 77.8,\n561\t      \"6class_robot\": 75.1,\n562\t      \"marginal_gain_per_expert\": 0.23,\n563\t      \"6class_routing_accuracy\": 94.8\n564\t    },\n565\t    \"tables\": [\n566\t      {\n567\t        \"name\": \"Granularity comparison\",\n568\t        \"data\": {\n569\t          \"headers\": [\n570\t            \"Granularity\",\n571\t            \"Experts\",\n572\t            \"Total Params\",\n573\t            \"Overall (%)\",\n574\t            \"Routing Acc (%)\",\n575\t            \"Δ\"\n576\t          ],\n577\t          \"rows\": [\n578\t            [\n579\t              \"3-class\",\n580\t              \"3\",\n581\t              \"12M\",\n582\t              \"78.9\",\n583\t              \"96.8\",\n584\t              \"—\"\n585\t            ],\n586\t            [\n587\t              \"6-class\",\n588\t              \"6\",\n589\t              \"24M\",\n590\t              \"79.6\",\n591\t              \"94.8\",\n592\t              \"+0.7\"\n593\t            ]\n594\t          ]\n595\t        }\n596\t      }\n597\t    ],\n598\t    \"figures\": [],\n599\t    \"analysis\": \"0.7pp / 2× params 的 trade-off 验证了 3-class taxonomy 的合理性，回应 Reviewer C5。Phase 0 的 Visual cluster 紧致性是根本原因——finer granularity within Visual 增加 routing 难度但不增加修正多样性。\\n\\n\\n6-class 仅比 3-class 高 0.7pp（79.6% vs 78.9%），参数量翻倍（24M vs 12M）， 每额外 expert 的边际收益仅 0.23pp。这与 Phase 0 的发现一致：intra-Visual 4 个 sub-type 在激活空间中形成一个紧致 cluster（6-class accuracy 99.8% 但 sub-type 间 cosine similarity 高达 0.92），说明 camera/light/background/noise 的修正策略高度重叠——它们都影响 early-layer visual representation，差异更多是 程度而非类型。Independent camera expert 比 shared LoRA-V 仅高 1.7pp（80.2% vs 78.5%），代价是独占 3.7M 参数。同时 6-class routing accuracy 下降到 94.8% （vs 3-class 96.8%），因为 6-class 边界更精细，分类更困难，少量 routing error 部分抵消了 expert specialization 的收益。3-class 是 granularity 的 sweet spot。\\n\"\n600\t  },\n601\t  {\n602\t    \"name\": \"Rank-48 Parameter-Matched Universal LoRA — Existential Control\",\n603\t    \"description\": \"训练 rank-48 universal LoRA（~11.1M params，精确匹配 Meta-Brain 的 3×rank-16 expert 参数总量）。若 rank-48 ≈ Meta-Brain → Claim 2 崩溃。\\n\",\n604\t    \"results\": {\n605\t      \"rank48_overall\": 65.1,\n606\t      \"rank48_std\": 1.3,\n607\t      \"rank48_visual\": 67.5,\n608\t      \"rank48_spatial\": 63.2,\n609\t      \"rank48_physical\": 60.8,\n610\t      \"rank48_vs_meta_brain_gap\": 13.8,\n611\t      \"rank48_vs_r16_improvement\": 2.7,\n612\t      \"rank48_gain_over_frozen\": 11.5,\n613\t      \"rank48_gain_per_M\": 0.96,\n614\t      \"claim2_survival\": true\n615\t    },\n616\t    \"tables\": [],\n617\t    \"figures\": [],\n618\t    \"analysis\": \"全文最关键的单个实验。13.8pp gap + p<0.001 直接证明 routing 的价值不可被 parameter scaling 替代。如果这个 gap <5pp，整篇论文的 thesis 就需要根本性重构。 在 best 档下，gap 足够大且稳健，Claim 2 完整存活。\\n\\n\\nRank-48 universal LoRA 达到 65.1%（+11.5pp over frozen），仅比 rank-16 （62.4%）高 2.7pp，despite 3.2× 参数增长（3.7M → 11.1M）。这证实了 \\\"universal capacity saturation\\\" 假设：uniform LoRA 的收益在 rank 16-48 之间快速递减。根本原因：rank-48 的 11.1M 参数被迫在三种修正方向（visual: early-layer re-projection, spatial: mid-layer trajectory adjustment, physical: late-layer action re-planning）之间共享。这三种修正在 representation space 中 方向不同甚至互斥——改善 visual robustness 的 rank 方向可能削弱 spatial 性能。 增加 rank 只是增加了妥协的参数量，无法解决方向冲突。per-type 分布清晰展示了 这个困境：Visual（67.5%）的 gain over frozen（+16.7pp）远大于 Spatial（+5.7pp） 和 Physical（+4.6pp），因为 visual perturbation 在混合训练数据中占 4/6 sub-types， universal LoRA 被 biased toward visual correction。Meta-Brain 的 3 experts 各自专注一种类型，消除了方向冲突和数据 imbalance。13.8pp gap（p<0.001） 是 Claim 2 的 existential validation：identical parameter budget, dramatically different outcome。\\n\"\n619\t  },\n620\t  {\n621\t    \"name\": \"LoRA Rank Sweep (r=16/32/64)\",\n622\t    \"description\": \"在 r=16/32/64 三个 expert rank 上分别训练 Meta-Brain 和 parameter-matched universal LoRA，测试 routing benefit 是否随 expert capacity 增长而变化。\\n\",\n623\t    \"results\": {\n624\t      \"r16_meta_brain\": 78.9,\n625\t      \"r16_universal_matched\": 65.1,\n626\t      \"r16_routing_benefit\": 13.8,\n627\t      \"r16_total_params_M\": 12,\n628\t      \"r32_meta_brain\": 81.5,\n629\t      \"r32_universal_matched\": 67.6,\n630\t      \"r32_routing_benefit\": 13.9,\n631\t      \"r32_total_params_M\": 24,\n632\t      \"r64_meta_brain\": 84.2,\n633\t      \"r64_universal_matched\": 70.0,\n634\t      \"r64_routing_benefit\": 14.2,\n635\t      \"r64_total_params_M\": 48,\n636\t      \"benefit_trend\": \"monotonically increasing\",\n637\t      \"universal_diminishing_returns_r48_to_r96\": 2.5,\n638\t      \"universal_diminishing_returns_r96_to_r192\": 2.4\n639\t    },\n640\t    \"tables\": [\n641\t      {\n642\t        \"name\": \"Rank sweep results\",\n643\t        \"data\": {\n644\t          \"headers\": [\n645\t            \"Expert Rank\",\n646\t            \"Meta-Brain (%)\",\n647\t            \"Matched Universal (%)\",\n648\t            \"Routing Benefit (pp)\",\n649\t            \"Total Params\"\n650\t          ],\n651\t          \"rows\": [\n652\t            [\n653\t              \"r=16\",\n654\t              \"78.9\",\n655\t              \"65.1\",\n656\t              \"13.8\",\n657\t              \"12M\"\n658\t            ],\n659\t            [\n660\t              \"r=32\",\n661\t              \"81.5\",\n662\t              \"67.6\",\n663\t              \"13.9\",\n664\t              \"24M\"\n665\t            ],\n666\t            [\n667\t              \"r=64\",\n668\t              \"84.2\",\n669\t              \"70.0\",\n670\t              \"14.2\",\n671\t              \"48M\"\n672\t            ]\n673\t          ]\n674\t        }\n675\t      }\n676\t    ],\n677\t    \"figures\": [],\n678\t    \"analysis\": \"Monotonically increasing routing benefit 是一个 clean scaling result。 它也暗示 r=64 Meta-Brain（84.2%）可以 match 或超过 VLA-GSE（81.2%，不同 backbone），虽然 cross-backbone 对比是 indirect，但趋势线的 extrapolation 支持 Meta-Brain 在更高 capacity 下的 competitive potential。\\n\\n\\nRouting benefit 单调递增（13.8→13.9→14.2pp），排除了 Dream worst-case \\\"routing benefit 仅在特定 capacity 下出现\\\" 的顾虑。递增的机制： (1) 更高 rank 的 expert 能捕获更精细的 type-specific correction（r=64 LoRA-V on visual ~86%），这些精细修正的价值在 universal setting 下被 dilute 掉—— universal 必须在三种修正之间分配每一个 rank component。 (2) Universal LoRA 的 scaling 呈递减：r48→r96 仅 +2.5pp, r96→r192 仅 +2.4pp， 因为额外 rank 被用于 refine 已有的妥协方案，而非学习新的修正维度。 (3) Meta-Brain 的 scaling 近似线性（78.9→81.5→84.2，每次 ~+2.6pp）， 因为每个 expert 的额外 rank 直接用于 deepen 该类型的专有修正，没有 cross-type interference。两条 scaling curve 的斜率差导致 benefit gap 缓慢扩大。 这个 finding 的叙事意义：routing benefit 不是特定 capacity 的 artifact， 而是 fundamental architectural advantage——无论参数预算大小，routing 始终优于 uniform correction。如果有更多参数预算，应投入到更高 rank 的 routed experts。\\n\"\n679\t  },\n680\t  {\n681\t    \"name\": \"Clean LIBERO Evaluation\",\n682\t    \"description\": \"在标准（无扰动）LIBERO 上评估 Meta-Brain 和 baselines，验证 routing 不会 降低 nominal performance。\\n\",\n683\t    \"results\": {\n684\t      \"frozen_pi0_clean\": 91.2,\n685\t      \"universal_r16_clean\": 90.8,\n686\t      \"universal_r48_clean\": 90.5,\n687\t      \"meta_brain_clean\": 91.5,\n688\t      \"clean_delta_meta_brain\": 0.3,\n689\t      \"clean_delta_r16\": -0.4,\n690\t      \"clean_delta_r48\": -0.7,\n691\t      \"par_routing_entropy_on_clean\": 0.85,\n692\t      \"par_routing_weight_distribution_clean\": \"≈ 0.34/0.33/0.33\"\n693\t    },\n694\t    \"tables\": [\n695\t      {\n696\t        \"name\": \"Clean LIBERO preservation\",\n697\t        \"data\": {\n698\t          \"headers\": [\n699\t            \"Method\",\n700\t            \"Clean LIBERO (%)\",\n701\t            \"Δ vs Frozen (pp)\"\n702\t          ],\n703\t          \"rows\": [\n704\t            [\n705\t              \"Frozen pi0\",\n706\t              \"91.2\",\n707\t              \"—\"\n708\t            ],\n709\t            [\n710\t              \"Universal r16\",\n711\t              \"90.8\",\n712\t              \"-0.4\"\n713\t            ],\n714\t            [\n715\t              \"Universal r48\",\n716\t              \"90.5\",\n717\t              \"-0.7\"\n718\t            ],\n719\t            [\n720\t              \"Meta-Brain\",\n721\t              \"91.5\",\n722\t              \"+0.3\"\n723\t            ]\n724\t          ]\n725\t        }\n726\t      }\n727\t    ],\n728\t    \"figures\": [],\n729\t    \"analysis\": \"Clean LIBERO preservation 是 practical deployment argument 的关键证据。 Meta-Brain 是唯一在 perturbed 和 clean 条件下都不降级的方法。PAR routing 的 high-entropy fallback 是一个 emergent property（非刻意设计），可作为 \\\"routing 自动 detect perturbation absence\\\" 的附加 insight 呈现。\\n\\n\\nMeta-Brain 在 clean LIBERO 上 91.5%（Δ=+0.3pp vs frozen），完全保持 nominal 性能。这得益于 PAR router 的一个 emergent 行为：在无扰动输入下，layer 6 first-token 激活不匹配任何已知扰动 pattern，PAR 输出高 entropy（0.85， 接近 max log(3)=1.10），routing weights 近似均匀（~0.33/0.33/0.33）。 三个 expert 的修正在 clean input 上大致方向相反（各自 tuned 为不同扰动的 correction），均匀加权后 net correction ≈ 0——routing 自动 degrade to identity。微弱的 +0.3pp 正 delta 可能来自 expert LoRA 的轻微 regularization 效果。对比 Universal LoRA：r16 下降 0.4pp, r48 下降 0.7pp，因为 universal LoRA 始终应用 correction（无 \\\"关闭\\\" 机制），对 clean input 造成不必要的 representation perturbation。Rank 越高干扰越大（r48 的 -0.7pp），因为 higher-rank LoRA 的 representation 修改幅度更大。这为 deployment 增加了 重要论据：Meta-Brain 的 routing 机制在正常条件下安全 graceful degrade， 而 always-on universal correction 有代价。\\n\"\n730\t  },\n731\t  {\n732\t    \"name\": \"Cross-Backbone Validation (SmolVLA)\",\n733\t    \"description\": \"在 SmolVLA 上复现 Phase 0 + Phase 1 核心 pipeline，验证 perturbation-diagnostic routing 的跨架构泛化性。P2 优先级。\\n\",\n734\t    \"results\": {\n735\t      \"smolvla_phase0_3class_f1\": 0.971,\n736\t      \"smolvla_phase0_best_layer\": 4,\n737\t      \"smolvla_frozen_libero_plus\": 49.8,\n738\t      \"smolvla_universal_r16\": 58.2,\n739\t      \"smolvla_meta_brain\": 72.4,\n740\t      \"smolvla_gain_over_frozen\": 22.6,\n741\t      \"smolvla_routing_benefit_vs_universal\": 14.2,\n742\t      \"smolvla_routing_accuracy\": 94.5\n743\t    },\n744\t    \"tables\": [\n745\t      {\n746\t        \"name\": \"Cross-backbone comparison\",\n747\t        \"data\": {\n748\t          \"headers\": [\n749\t            \"Metric\",\n750\t            \"pi0 (PaliGemma)\",\n751\t            \"SmolVLA\"\n752\t          ],\n753\t          \"rows\": [\n754\t            [\n755\t              \"Phase 0 3-class F1\",\n756\t              \"0.993\",\n757\t              \"0.971\"\n758\t            ],\n759\t            [\n760\t              \"Best probing layer\",\n761\t              \"6 / 18\",\n762\t              \"4 / 12\"\n763\t            ],\n764\t            [\n765\t              \"Frozen baseline (%)\",\n766\t              \"53.6\",\n767\t              \"49.8\"\n768\t            ],\n769\t            [\n770\t              \"Universal r16 (%)\",\n771\t              \"62.4\",\n772\t              \"58.2\"\n773\t            ],\n774\t            [\n775\t              \"Meta-Brain (%)\",\n776\t              \"78.9\",\n777\t              \"72.4\"\n778\t            ],\n779\t            [\n780\t              \"Routing benefit (pp)\",\n781\t              \"13.8\",\n782\t              \"14.2\"\n783\t            ]\n784\t          ]\n785\t        }\n786\t      }\n787\t    ],\n788\t    \"figures\": [],\n789\t    \"analysis\": \"Cross-backbone validation 将 contribution 从 \\\"pi0 上有效的 technique\\\" 提升为 \\\"VLA 的通用 robustness principle\\\"。routing benefit 在两个 backbone 上的 高度一致性（13.8 vs 14.2pp）是最有说服力的 generalization evidence。 直接回应 Reviewer C3。\\n\\n\\nSmolVLA Phase 0 F1=0.971（vs pi0 0.993），略低但仍极高，验证了 perturbation diagnosability 不是 PaliGemma 架构的特有属性。Best layer 是 layer 4 （SmolVLA 共 ~12 层），深度比例 ~1/3 与 pi0 的 layer 6/18 一致， 暗示 perturbation information 在 VLA 中的 consolidation 发生在相对一致的 depth fraction。Phase 0 F1 略低的原因：SmolVLA 的 representation 维度更小， perturbation cluster 间的 margin 更窄，但仍足以支撑高质量 routing。 Meta-Brain on SmolVLA 达到 72.4%（+22.6pp over frozen 49.8%）， routing benefit vs universal 为 14.2pp（vs pi0 上的 13.8pp），定量吻合度很高。 SmolVLA 绝对性能低于 pi0（72.4% vs 78.9%）因为 backbone capacity 更小， 但 routing benefit 的相对大小几乎相同（14.2 vs 13.8），说明 routing 的价值不依赖于 backbone quality——无论 backbone 强弱， perturbation-type-specific correction 都比 uniform correction 更高效。\\n\"\n790\t  },\n791\t  {\n792\t    \"name\": \"LoRA Layer Placement Ablation\",\n793\t    \"description\": \"对比不同 PaliGemma 层覆盖范围（early 2-6, mid 6-12, late 12-16, all 2-16） 对各 expert type 的影响。P2 优先级。\\n\",\n794\t    \"results\": {\n795\t      \"lora_v_early\": 78.5,\n796\t      \"lora_v_mid\": 76.2,\n797\t      \"lora_v_late\": 72.8,\n798\t      \"lora_v_all\": 80.2,\n799\t      \"lora_s_early\": 73.5,\n800\t      \"lora_s_mid\": 76.8,\n801\t      \"lora_s_late\": 74.2,\n802\t      \"lora_s_all\": 77.5,\n803\t      \"lora_p_early\": 69.8,\n804\t      \"lora_p_mid\": 72.5,\n805\t      \"lora_p_late\": 74.5,\n806\t      \"lora_p_all\": 74.8,\n807\t      \"v_best_subset\": \"early (2-6)\",\n808\t      \"s_best_subset\": \"mid (6-12)\",\n809\t      \"p_best_subset\": \"late (12-16)\",\n810\t      \"v_all_minus_best_subset\": 1.7,\n811\t      \"s_all_minus_best_subset\": 0.7,\n812\t      \"p_all_minus_best_subset\": 0.3\n813\t    },\n814\t    \"tables\": [\n815\t      {\n816\t        \"name\": \"Layer placement ablation\",\n817\t        \"data\": {\n818\t          \"headers\": [\n819\t            \"Layers\",\n820\t            \"LoRA-V Visual (%)\",\n821\t            \"LoRA-S Spatial (%)\",\n822\t            \"LoRA-P Physical (%)\"\n823\t          ],\n824\t          \"rows\": [\n825\t            [\n826\t              \"Early (2-6)\",\n827\t              \"78.5 ★V\",\n828\t              \"73.5\",\n829\t              \"69.8\"\n830\t            ],\n831\t            [\n832\t              \"Mid (6-12)\",\n833\t              \"76.2\",\n834\t              \"76.8 ★S\",\n835\t              \"72.5\"\n836\t            ],\n837\t            [\n838\t              \"Late (12-16)\",\n839\t              \"72.8\",\n840\t              \"74.2\",\n841\t              \"74.5 ★P\"\n842\t            ],\n843\t            [\n844\t              \"All (2-16)\",\n845\t              \"80.2\",\n846\t              \"77.5\",\n847\t              \"74.8\"\n848\t            ]\n849\t          ]\n850\t        }\n851\t      }\n852\t    ],\n853\t    \"figures\": [],\n854\t    \"analysis\": \"V→early, S→mid, P→late 的对应关系提供了 mechanistic insight，支撑 \\\"不同扰动 影响不同处理阶段\\\" 的理论框架。这个 finding 虽然不影响主要 claim（all-layer 仍是实用最优），但作为 practical insight 增加了论文的理论深度。未来工作可 探索 layer-specific routing（根据扰动类型动态选择 active layers）。\\n\\nLayer placement 揭示了清晰的 V→early, S→mid, P→late 偏好梯度： LoRA-V 在 early layers 最优 subset（78.5%），因为视觉扰动（camera/light/ background/noise）破坏 early visual representation——在损坏发生处修正最高效。 Late layers（72.8%）最差（-7.4pp vs all），因为 corrupted features 已经 propagate 到深层并 compound，late-layer 修正无法 undo upstream corruption。 LoRA-S 在 mid layers 最优（76.8%），因为 spatial perturbation（layout 变化） 影响的是 visual-to-spatial reasoning 的转换阶段——mid layers 将 2D visual features 转化为 3D spatial-action representations。LoRA-P 在 late layers 最优（74.5%），且与 all-layer（74.8%）仅差 0.3pp，因为 physical perturbation （robot 初始状态变化）影响 high-level action planning，这发生在 late decision layers。但所有 expert 在 all-layer 覆盖下均为最优或接近最优，说明 cross-layer redundancy 有益——即使存在层偏好，拥有 all-layer coverage 可以 catch residual perturbation effects at other layers。v_all_minus_best_subset 最大（1.7pp）， 说明 visual perturbation 虽集中在 early layers 但 mid/late 仍有 residual impact。\\n\"\n855\t  }\n856\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5fb04169-24f8-4cc8-b045-fda2fee10af8","uuid":"53625f6e-2f77-457e-95d8-524c585d43a6","timestamp":"2026-05-15T17:56:33.597Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515/projects/meta_brain_lora_routing/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T165902/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LoRA Expert Training — 3 Specialized + 1 Universal\",\n    \"description\": \"Train 4 LoRA adapters (rank 16, Q/K/V/O on all 18 PaliGemma layers, 3.7M params each): LoRA-V (online visual augmentation), LoRA-S (oracle spatial demos), LoRA-P (oracle physical demos), Universal (mixed all-perturbation data). Evaluate each expert on its matched type AND cross-type.\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"lora_v_on_visual\": 80.2,\n      \"lora_v_on_spatial\": 62.0,\n      \"lora_v_on_physical\": 60.2,\n      \"lora_s_on_visual\": 59.5,\n      \"lora_s_on_spatial\": 77.5,\n      \"lora_s_on_physical\": 60.0,\n      \"lora_p_on_visual\": 58.2,\n      \"lora_p_on_spatial\": 60.8,\n      \"lora_p_on_physical\": 74.8,\n      \"universal_r16_visual\": 64.8,\n      \"universal_r16_spatial\": 60.5,\n      \"universal_r16_physical\": 58.2,\n      \"universal_r16_overall\": 62.4,\n      \"cross_type_avg_drop_pp\": 17.4,\n      \"val_action_mse_lora_v\": 0.0082,\n      \"val_action_mse_lora_s\": 0.0091,\n      \"val_action_mse_lora_p\": 0.0098,\n      \"val_action_mse_universal\": 0.0105,\n      \"convergence_epochs\": 15\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Cross-type evaluation matrix\",\n        \"description\": \"3×3 expert-vs-type matrix + universal 行。对角线显著高于非对角线 （avg drop 17.4pp），验证修正不可互换。\\n\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"headers\": [\n            \"Expert \\\\ Type\",\n            \"Visual (%)\",\n            \"Spatial (%)\",\n            \"Physical (%)\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"LoRA-V\",\n              \"80.2 ★\",\n              \"62.0\",\n              \"60.2\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"LoRA-S\",\n              \"59.5\",\n              \"77.5 ★\",\n              \"60.0\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"LoRA-P\",\n              \"58.2\",\n              \"60.8\",\n              \"74.8 ★\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Universal-r16\",\n              \"64.8\",\n              \"60.5\",\n              \"58.2\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Frozen pi0\",\n              \"50.8\",\n              \"57.5\",\n              \"56.2\"\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Cross-type drop 全部 >15pp（最小 15.3pp for LoRA-P on spatial，最大 19.1pp for LoRA-V on spatial/physical avg），直接验证 Claim 2 的前提假设。Universal LoRA 在所有类型上都不如对应的 matched expert（差距 12-17pp），确立了 routing 的必要性。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，perturbation-specific LoRA 学到了质性不同的修正模式。LoRA-V 在 视觉扰动上达到 80.2%（+29.4pp over frozen），因为在线增强（camera jitter, brightness shift, background swap, Gaussian noise）精确匹配 LIBERO-Plus 视觉 扰动分布，LoRA 只需学习 early-layer visual representation 的低秩修正。LoRA-S 和 LoRA-P 在各自类型上分别达到 77.5%/74.8%，略低于 LoRA-V，原因有二：(1) spatial 和 physical 的 oracle demo 采集本身引入采集噪声；(2) 空间和物理扰动涉及 action-level 的高层语义调整，比纯视觉修正的 representation 变换更复杂。 关键证据在 cross-type performance：LoRA-V 在 spatial 上仅 62.0%（drop 18.2pp）， 因为视觉修正无法纠正 layout 引起的 action trajectory 偏移——这两种修正在 representation space 中方向正交。LoRA-P 在 visual 上仅 58.2%（drop 16.6pp）， 因为力学修正作用于 late-layer action planning，反而干扰了本该保持的 early-layer visual features。cross-type 仍高于 frozen（58-62% vs 50-57%），说明 experts 学到了部分可迁移的通用 robustness（如 LoRA 的低秩约束本身有 regularization 效果）， 但 type-specific 部分不可互换。Universal LoRA 在各类型上均为中等水平（58-65%）， 是典型的 jack-of-all-trades：3.7M 参数被迫在三种修正方向之间妥协， 每个方向分到的有效容量不足以匹配专有 expert。Val MSE 证实了这一点：专有 expert （0.008-0.010）显著低于 universal（0.0105），说明 specialization 带来更精确的 action prediction。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Meta-Brain Assembly — PAR Router + LoRA Bank E2E\",\n    \"description\": \"组装 PAR router (PaliGemma layer 6, 2-layer MLP, first-token pooling) + 3 LoRA experts，soft routing: h_corrected = h_frozen + Σ_k p(type_k)·LoRA_k(h_frozen)。 冻结 LoRA 参数，仅微调 PAR routing weights。全 LIBERO-Plus benchmark 评估。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"libero_plus_overall\": 78.9,\n      \"libero_plus_std\": 1.2,\n      \"per_type_visual\": 81.2,\n      \"per_type_spatial\": 77.5,\n      \"per_type_physical\": 74.8,\n      \"per_subtype_camera\": 78.5,\n      \"per_subtype_light\": 83.8,\n      \"per_subtype_background\": 80.2,\n      \"per_subtype_noise\": 82.1,\n      \"per_subtype_layout\": 77.5,\n      \"per_subtype_robot\": 74.8,\n      \"routing_weight_visual_on_lora_v\": 0.91,\n      \"routing_weight_spatial_on_lora_s\": 0.88,\n      \"routing_weight_physical_on_lora_p\": 0.86,\n      \"routing_entropy_visual\": 0.12,\n      \"routing_entropy_spatial\": 0.15,\n      \"routing_entropy_physical\": 0.18,\n      \"par_routing_accuracy\": 96.8,\n      \"e2e_finetuning_epochs\": 5,\n      \"total_trainable_params_M\": 11.6\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"LIBERO-Plus per-perturbation breakdown\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"headers\": [\n            \"Perturbation\",\n            \"Type\",\n            \"Success (%)\",\n            \"Δ Frozen (pp)\",\n            \"Routing Weight\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"Camera\",\n              \"Visual\",\n              \"78.5\",\n              \"+30.3\",\n              \"LoRA-V: 0.92\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Light\",\n              \"Visual\",\n              \"83.8\",\n              \"+31.3\",\n              \"LoRA-V: 0.93\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Background\",\n              \"Visual\",\n              \"80.2\",\n              \"+29.4\",\n              \"LoRA-V: 0.90\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Noise\",\n              \"Visual\",\n              \"82.1\",\n              \"+28.9\",\n              \"LoRA-V: 0.89\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Layout\",\n              \"Spatial\",\n              \"77.5\",\n              \"+20.0\",\n              \"LoRA-S: 0.88\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Robot\",\n              \"Physical\",\n              \"74.8\",\n              \"+18.6\",\n              \"LoRA-P: 0.86\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Overall\",\n              \"—\",\n              \"78.9\",\n              \"+25.3\",\n              \"—\"\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"78.9% overall + near-diagonal routing weights + 96.8% routing accuracy 共同 构成 best 档核心证据。routing entropy 的 per-type 差异（0.12 visual vs 0.18 physical）反映了 Phase 0 分类精度的差异——但即使 physical 的 entropy 也远低于 maximum（0.18 vs log(3)=1.10），确认所有类型的 routing 都高度确定。\\n\\n\\n78.9% 整体成功率来自三个因素的协同：(1) PAR router routing accuracy 达 96.8%—— Phase 0 已证明 layer 6 first-token 激活在 3-class 上 F1=1.0，端到端微调只需 轻微校准 soft routing 的温度参数；(2) soft routing entropy 极低（0.12-0.18）， 说明 router 对每种扰动类型高度确信，routing weights 近似 one-hot（视觉扰动时 LoRA-V 权重 0.91），使 Meta-Brain 在运行时近似 oracle routing——这直接解释了 oracle gap 仅 1.8pp；(3) 各 expert 本身质量高（plan_002 验证），routing 只需 选对 expert 即可。per-type 排序 V>S>P（81.2>77.5>74.8）反映了扰动修正的内在 难度梯度：视觉扰动是最规则的低秩变换（brightness/contrast 近似线性），空间扰动 需要调整 mid-level spatial reasoning，物理扰动涉及 action planning 的高层语义 重构。per-subtype 中 light 最高（83.8%）因为亮度变化是最平滑的视觉扰动， camera 稍低（78.5%）因为视角变化需要更复杂的几何 re-projection。Physical expert 的 routing confidence 稍低（0.86 vs 0.91）因为物理扰动在激活空间中的 cluster 略松散（Phase 0: physical F1=0.951 at K=1 vs spatial F1=1.0）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Oracle Routing Ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"用 ground-truth 扰动类型标签（hard one-hot）替换 PAR router，测量 learned routing 与 perfect routing 的上界差距。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"oracle_overall\": 80.7,\n      \"oracle_std\": 0.9,\n      \"oracle_visual\": 83.0,\n      \"oracle_spatial\": 79.2,\n      \"oracle_physical\": 76.5,\n      \"oracle_minus_meta_brain_overall\": 1.8,\n      \"oracle_minus_meta_brain_visual\": 1.8,\n      \"oracle_minus_meta_brain_spatial\": 1.7,\n      \"oracle_minus_meta_brain_physical\": 1.7\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"1.8pp gap 证明 PAR router 不是系统瓶颈。未来提升应聚焦于 expert 质量 （更好训练数据、更高 rank）而非 router 改进。Oracle 结果也为 routing 设定了 performance ceiling：~80.7% 是 rank-16 expert bank 的理论上限。\\n\\n\\nOracle routing 达到 80.7%，仅比 Meta-Brain（78.9%）高 1.8pp。Gap 小于 routing 分类错误率所预测的值（routing accuracy 96.8% → 3.2% 错误 → 预期 impact ~3pp）， 因为 PAR 的 soft routing 在分类不完全正确时仍分配了较高权重给正确 expert （如 misrouted visual 案例中 LoRA-V 仍获 0.65 权重 vs LoRA-S 0.35），使得 routing error 的 downstream impact 被 dampen。per-type gap 高度一致 （1.7-1.8pp），说明 PAR router 在三种类型上的性能均衡，没有系统性偏向。 Physical 的 oracle gap（1.7pp）最小，看似反直觉（physical 的 routing accuracy 最低），但 physical expert 的 cross-type performance（60.0-60.8%）高于其他 expert 的 cross-type（58.2-62.0%），使得 misrouting 的惩罚较轻。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Ablation Ladder — Full Systematic Comparison\",\n    \"description\": \"LIBERO-Plus 上 6 个系统配置的系统对比（5 seeds）：Frozen → Universal-r16 → Universal-r48 → Random Routing → Meta-Brain → Oracle。包含 rank-48 parameter-matched control 和 random routing baseline。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"frozen_pi0_overall\": 53.6,\n      \"frozen_pi0_std\": 0.8,\n      \"universal_r16_overall\": 62.4,\n      \"universal_r16_std\": 1.4,\n      \"universal_r48_overall\": 65.1,\n      \"universal_r48_std\": 1.3,\n      \"random_routing_overall\": 65.8,\n      \"random_routing_std\": 2.1,\n      \"meta_brain_overall\": 78.9,\n      \"meta_brain_std\": 1.2,\n      \"oracle_routing_overall\": 80.7,\n      \"oracle_routing_std\": 0.9,\n      \"step_frozen_to_r16\": 8.8,\n      \"step_r16_to_r48\": 2.7,\n      \"step_r48_to_random\": 0.7,\n      \"step_random_to_meta_brain\": 13.1,\n      \"step_meta_brain_to_oracle\": 1.8,\n      \"routing_gap_vs_rank48\": 13.8,\n      \"routing_gap_vs_random\": 13.1,\n      \"random_vs_r48_pvalue\": 0.38,\n      \"meta_brain_vs_random_pvalue\": 3e-05,\n      \"meta_brain_vs_r48_pvalue\": 1e-05,\n      \"per_type_visual_frozen\": 50.8,\n      \"per_type_spatial_frozen\": 57.5,\n      \"per_type_physical_frozen\": 56.2,\n      \"per_type_visual_r48\": 67.5,\n      \"per_type_spatial_r48\": 63.2,\n      \"per_type_physical_r48\": 60.8,\n      \"per_type_visual_random\": 66.8,\n      \"per_type_spatial_random\": 65.5,\n      \"per_type_physical_random\": 63.2\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Ablation Ladder — Main Results (5 seeds)\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"headers\": [\n            \"Method\",\n            \"Params\",\n            \"Overall (%)\",\n            \"Visual (%)\",\n            \"Spatial (%)\",\n            \"Physical (%)\",\n            \"Δ Frozen\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"Frozen pi0\",\n              \"0\",\n              \"53.6 ± 0.8\",\n              \"50.8\",\n              \"57.5\",\n              \"56.2\",\n              \"—\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Universal r16\",\n              \"3.7M\",\n              \"62.4 ± 1.4\",\n              \"64.8\",\n              \"60.5\",\n              \"58.2\",\n              \"+8.8\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Universal r48\",\n              \"12M\",\n              \"65.1 ± 1.3\",\n              \"67.5\",\n              \"63.2\",\n              \"60.8\",\n              \"+11.5\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Random Routing\",\n              \"12M\",\n              \"65.8 ± 2.1\",\n              \"66.8\",\n              \"65.5\",\n              \"63.2\",\n              \"+12.2\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Meta-Brain (ours)\",\n              \"12M\",\n              \"78.9 ± 1.2\",\n              \"81.2\",\n              \"77.5\",\n              \"74.8\",\n              \"+25.3\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Oracle Routing\",\n              \"12M\",\n              \"80.7 ± 0.9\",\n              \"83.0\",\n              \"79.2\",\n              \"76.5\",\n              \"+27.1\"\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Statistical significance\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"headers\": [\n            \"Comparison\",\n            \"Gap (pp)\",\n            \"p-value\",\n            \"Significant?\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"Meta-Brain vs r48\",\n              \"13.8\",\n              \"<0.001\",\n              \"Yes (***)\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Meta-Brain vs Random\",\n              \"13.1\",\n              \"<0.001\",\n              \"Yes (***)\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Random vs r48\",\n              \"0.7\",\n              \"0.38\",\n              \"No (n.s.)\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Oracle vs Meta-Brain\",\n              \"1.8\",\n              \"0.03\",\n              \"Yes (*)\"\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"消融梯度提供三个推论：(a) routing >> ensemble（13.1pp vs 0.7pp, ratio 18.7×）； (b) routing >> capacity scaling（13.8pp vs 2.7pp, ratio 5.1×）； (c) PAR ≈ oracle（gap 1.8pp）。Random vs r48 的 null result（p=0.38）是 全文最关键的 negative finding——它排除了 Claim 2 的唯一 alternative explanation。\\n\\n\\n消融梯度严格单调递增（53.6→62.4→65.1→65.8→78.9→80.7），每一步对应一个 独立的能力维度： (1) Frozen→r16（+8.8pp）：LoRA 本身提供了通用的 representation correction 能力， 即使不区分扰动类型，低秩修正也能改善 feature robustness。 (2) r16→r48（+2.7pp）：增加 rank 有帮助但收益递减——3.2× 参数仅换来 2.7pp， 说明 universal correction 的 capacity utilization efficiency 随 rank 下降， 因为额外参数被迫在三种互斥修正方向上妥协。 (3) r48→Random（+0.7pp, p=0.38 不显著）：仅 3 个 expert 的 ensemble 效应 几乎不存在。Random routing 有时碰巧选对 expert（1/3 概率），拉高了均值， 但也有 2/3 概率选错并导致 suboptimal correction。这两个效应近似抵消， 使 random 仅比 universal 高 0.7pp。p=0.38 的不显著性是关键 null result—— 它排除了 \\\"Meta-Brain 的好处来自 ensemble averaging\\\" 的 alternative explanation。 (4) Random→Meta-Brain（+13.1pp, p<0.001）：整个梯度中最大的单步跳跃。 精确 routing 带来的提升远超 capacity scaling（2.7pp）和 ensemble（0.7pp）的 总和——routing 的边际贡献（13.1pp）是 capacity scaling（2.7pp）的 4.9×。 这是 Claim 2 的核心量化证据。 (5) Meta-Brain→Oracle（+1.8pp）：PAR router 接近理论上限。 Random routing 的高 std（2.1 vs Meta-Brain 的 1.2）反映了随机 expert 分配的 天然不稳定性——在某些 seed 下碰巧匹配较多，在其他 seed 下则严重不匹配。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"FTM/FLA Reproduction — Visual-Only Baseline\",\n    \"description\": \"在 pi0 backbone 上复现 FTM（Fine-Tuning Masking），对比 FTM vs Meta-Brain 在视觉扰动上的表现，并展示 Meta-Brain 在 spatial/physical 上的独特优势。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"ftm_visual_avg\": 75.7,\n      \"ftm_camera\": 73.2,\n      \"ftm_light\": 78.5,\n      \"ftm_background\": 74.8,\n      \"ftm_noise\": 76.2,\n      \"ftm_spatial\": 55.8,\n      \"ftm_physical\": 54.5,\n      \"ftm_overall\": 65.2,\n      \"ftm_params_K\": 4,\n      \"meta_brain_vs_ftm_visual_gap\": 5.5,\n      \"meta_brain_vs_ftm_spatial_gap\": 21.7,\n      \"meta_brain_vs_ftm_physical_gap\": 20.3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"FTM vs Meta-Brain comparison\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"headers\": [\n            \"Method\",\n            \"Params\",\n            \"Visual (%)\",\n            \"Spatial (%)\",\n            \"Physical (%)\",\n            \"Overall (%)\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"Frozen pi0\",\n              \"0\",\n              \"50.8\",\n              \"57.5\",\n              \"56.2\",\n              \"53.6\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"FTM (reprod.)\",\n              \"4K\",\n              \"75.7\",\n              \"55.8\",\n              \"54.5\",\n              \"65.2\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Meta-Brain\",\n              \"12M\",\n              \"81.2\",\n              \"77.5\",\n              \"74.8\",\n              \"78.9\"\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"FTM 是 visual-only robustness 的 strong baseline，且参数效率极高。论文中应定位为 \\\"single-modality approach 的代表\\\"——它证明了 visual 修正可以极其高效， 但也证明了 single-modality 无法推广到 multi-type perturbation 场景。 Meta-Brain 即使在 visual-only 上也优于 FTM（+5.5pp），说明 LoRA-based correction 比 feature masking 更有表达力。\\n\\n\\nFTM 在 pi0 上复现后视觉扰动达 75.7%（+24.9pp over frozen），以极少参数（4K） 实现了可观修正，验证了 FTM 的 feature masking 原理在 pi0 上同样有效—— masking 通过抑制 early-layer 中被扰动 corrupted 的 feature channel 来恢复 clean representation。但 FTM 在 spatial（55.8%）和 physical（54.5%）上等同于 frozen baseline 甚至略低（spatial -1.7pp），因为 FTM 的核心假设是扰动破坏 视觉特征——对 layout 变化或机器人初始状态变化，masking visual channels 不仅 无益反而可能抑制有用的 spatial/physical 信号。Meta-Brain 在视觉扰动上也高于 FTM（81.2% vs 75.7%，+5.5pp），因为 rank-16 LoRA（3.7M params）比 feature masking（4K params）有更大的修正表达能力——LoRA 可以 rotate 和 scale 整个 subspace，而 masking 只能 zero-out channels。但 FTM 的极高参数效率 （4K params for +24.9pp on visual）使其在 visual-only 场景下仍然有独特价值。 核心对比：Meta-Brain 在 spatial/physical 上分别高出 FTM 21.7pp 和 20.3pp， 这正是 multi-type routing 的 unique value proposition。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Parameter Efficiency Analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"计算各方法的 gain-over-frozen-baseline，按可训练参数归一化， 绘制 parameter efficiency scatter plot。纯分析，无 GPU 计算。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"meta_brain_gain_pp\": 25.3,\n      \"meta_brain_params_M\": 12,\n      \"meta_brain_gain_per_M\": 2.11,\n      \"universal_r16_gain_pp\": 8.8,\n      \"universal_r16_params_M\": 3.7,\n      \"universal_r16_gain_per_M\": 2.38,\n      \"universal_r48_gain_pp\": 11.5,\n      \"universal_r48_params_M\": 12,\n      \"universal_r48_gain_per_M\": 0.96,\n      \"ftm_gain_visual_pp\": 24.9,\n      \"ftm_gain_overall_pp\": 11.6,\n      \"ftm_params_M\": 0.004,\n      \"ftm_gain_per_M_visual\": 6225.0,\n      \"ftm_gain_per_M_overall\": 2900.0,\n      \"vla_gse_gain_pp\": 12.0,\n      \"vla_gse_params_M\": 114,\n      \"vla_gse_gain_per_M\": 0.105,\n      \"meta_brain_pareto_optimal\": true,\n      \"meta_brain_vs_r48_efficiency_ratio\": 2.2\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Parameter efficiency summary\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"headers\": [\n            \"Method\",\n            \"Backbone\",\n            \"Params\",\n            \"Gain (pp)\",\n            \"Gain/M\",\n            \"Coverage\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"FTM\",\n              \"pi0\",\n              \"4K\",\n              \"+24.9 (V) / +11.6 (all)\",\n              \"6225 / 2900\",\n              \"Visual only\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Universal r16\",\n              \"pi0\",\n              \"3.7M\",\n              \"+8.8\",\n              \"2.38\",\n              \"All types\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Meta-Brain (ours)\",\n              \"pi0\",\n              \"12M\",\n              \"+25.3\",\n              \"2.11\",\n              \"All types\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Universal r48\",\n              \"pi0\",\n              \"12M\",\n              \"+11.5\",\n              \"0.96\",\n              \"All types\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"VLA-GSE †\",\n              \"Qwen3-4B\",\n              \"114M\",\n              \"+12.0\",\n              \"0.105\",\n              \"All types\"\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Meta-Brain 是 multi-type robustness 场景下的 Pareto optimal 方法。关键 insight： routing 让同等参数预算（12M）的效率提升 2.2×——这不是 architectural overhead 的代价，而是 capacity allocation strategy 的收益。Parameter efficiency scatter 是 Claim 3 的 primary visual evidence。\\n\\n\\n参数效率分析揭示了三个 regime：(1) 极低参数区（<1M）：FTM 以 4K params 在 visual-only 上达到 gain_per_M=6225，但 overall gain_per_M（2900）反映了它 无法覆盖 non-visual 的局限；(2) 中等参数区（1-15M）：Meta-Brain 占据 Pareto 前沿——12M params, 25.3pp gain, gain_per_M=2.11。同参数量的 Universal-r48 仅 gain_per_M=0.96，效率差 2.2×。这 2.2× 的效率倍数就是 routing 的量化贡献； (3) 高参数区（>100M）：VLA-GSE 的 114M params 仅提供 gain_per_M=0.105 （不同 backbone，仅作 suggestive 对比）。即使考虑 backbone 差异，Meta-Brain 的 gain_per_M（2.11）比 VLA-GSE（0.105）高 20×，数量级差异足以支撑 parameter efficiency narrative。Universal r16 的 gain_per_M（2.38）看似高于 Meta-Brain （2.11），但绝对 gain 仅 8.8pp vs 25.3pp——在 \\\"达到实用性能阈值\\\" 的约束下， r16 的高效率无意义，因为 62.4% 可能低于部署要求。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Correction Memory Ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"对比 Meta-Brain with/without Correction Memory (CM)，量化 CM 的边际收益。 CM 通过 FAISS 检索相似历史扰动的 routing weight 来调制当前 routing。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"meta_brain_no_cm\": 78.9,\n      \"meta_brain_with_cm\": 80.1,\n      \"cm_delta_overall\": 1.2,\n      \"cm_delta_visual\": 0.8,\n      \"cm_delta_spatial\": 1.5,\n      \"cm_delta_physical\": 1.8,\n      \"cm_additional_params\": 1,\n      \"cm_latency_overhead_ms\": 2.3,\n      \"cm_pvalue\": 0.08\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"CM 是 optional module，+1.2pp 不改变任何 claim 的结论。论文呈现策略： 一行 ablation 文字 + footnote table，明确标注 \\\"optional, borderline significant\\\"。 Dream reviewers 一致认为 CM 是 padding，降级处理是正确决策。\\n\\n\\nCM 提供 +1.2pp 整体提升（p=0.08, borderline significant with 5 seeds）， 主要来自 spatial（+1.5pp）和 physical（+1.8pp）而非 visual（+0.8pp）。 这符合 CM 的设计逻辑：CM 检索与当前 observation 最相似的历史扰动 exemplar， 用其 routing weight 作为 contextual prior 来调制 PAR 输出。Spatial 和 physical 扰动的 within-type 变异更大（不同 layout randomization 的具体形态差异远大于 不同 lighting condition），历史 exemplar 能提供有用的 \\\"这种具体 layout 变化 应该如何调整 routing\\\" 的信息。Visual 上 CM 收益小因为 PAR 对视觉扰动已经 足够准确（routing accuracy ~98% on visual），contextual modulation 的改进空间 有限。但 +1.2pp 的总收益与 1 个额外可学习参数 + 2.3ms CPU latency 相比， cost-benefit 偏低——不值得作为 named architectural component 推广。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Router Architecture Comparison\",\n    \"description\": \"对比 3 种 PAR router 变体：2-layer MLP (default), linear classifier, attention-based router。均使用 PaliGemma layer 6 first-token features。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"mlp_routing_accuracy\": 96.8,\n      \"mlp_downstream\": 78.9,\n      \"mlp_params_M\": 0.53,\n      \"linear_routing_accuracy\": 94.2,\n      \"linear_downstream\": 76.8,\n      \"linear_params_M\": 0.01,\n      \"attention_routing_accuracy\": 97.1,\n      \"attention_downstream\": 78.5,\n      \"attention_params_M\": 1.85\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Router architecture comparison\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"headers\": [\n            \"Router Type\",\n            \"Params (M)\",\n            \"Routing Acc (%)\",\n            \"Downstream (%)\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"Linear\",\n              \"0.01\",\n              \"94.2\",\n              \"76.8\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"2-layer MLP ★\",\n              \"0.53\",\n              \"96.8\",\n              \"78.9\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Attention\",\n              \"1.85\",\n              \"97.1\",\n              \"78.5\"\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Router 架构的 downstream impact 有限（max spread 2.1pp），说明 Meta-Brain 的性能主要由 routing 原理和 expert 质量驱动，而非 router 实现细节。 论文中作简短 ablation paragraph 处理。\\n\\n\\nMLP（96.8% routing, 78.9% downstream）是最优 cost-performance 均衡。Linear 分类器准确率低 2.6pp（94.2%），因为 3-class 边界在激活空间中有轻微非线性—— Phase 0 t-SNE 显示 Spatial/Physical cluster 的边界不完全线性可分（两者都 影响 action space，共享部分特征），MLP 的一层隐藏层足以 model 这个非线性。 2.6pp routing gap 转化为 2.1pp downstream gap（76.8% vs 78.9%），说明 routing accuracy 和 task success 近似线性相关但有 damping（soft routing 缓冲了部分 routing error）。Attention-based router routing accuracy 最高 （97.1%），但 downstream 反而略低（78.5%），因为 1.85M 额外参数在仅 5 epoch 微调下轻微 overfit——attention 的表达能力对 3-class routing 过剩。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"6-class vs 3-class Routing\",\n    \"description\": \"对比 6-class 精细路由（camera/light/background/noise/layout/robot 各一个 LoRA expert，6×3.7M=22.1M params）vs 3-class 粗路由（Visual/Spatial/Physical， 3×3.7M=11.1M params）。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"3class_overall\": 78.9,\n      \"3class_params_M\": 12,\n      \"6class_overall\": 79.6,\n      \"6class_params_M\": 24,\n      \"6class_delta\": 0.7,\n      \"6class_camera\": 80.2,\n      \"6class_light\": 84.5,\n      \"6class_background\": 81.0,\n      \"6class_noise\": 83.2,\n      \"6class_layout\": 77.8,\n      \"6class_robot\": 75.1,\n      \"marginal_gain_per_expert\": 0.23,\n      \"6class_routing_accuracy\": 94.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Granularity comparison\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"headers\": [\n            \"Granularity\",\n            \"Experts\",\n            \"Total Params\",\n            \"Overall (%)\",\n            \"Routing Acc (%)\",\n            \"Δ\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"3-class\",\n              \"3\",\n              \"12M\",\n              \"78.9\",\n              \"96.8\",\n              \"—\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"6-class\",\n              \"6\",\n              \"24M\",\n              \"79.6\",\n              \"94.8\",\n              \"+0.7\"\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"0.7pp / 2× params 的 trade-off 验证了 3-class taxonomy 的合理性，回应 Reviewer C5。Phase 0 的 Visual cluster 紧致性是根本原因——finer granularity within Visual 增加 routing 难度但不增加修正多样性。\\n\\n\\n6-class 仅比 3-class 高 0.7pp（79.6% vs 78.9%），参数量翻倍（24M vs 12M）， 每额外 expert 的边际收益仅 0.23pp。这与 Phase 0 的发现一致：intra-Visual 4 个 sub-type 在激活空间中形成一个紧致 cluster（6-class accuracy 99.8% 但 sub-type 间 cosine similarity 高达 0.92），说明 camera/light/background/noise 的修正策略高度重叠——它们都影响 early-layer visual representation，差异更多是 程度而非类型。Independent camera expert 比 shared LoRA-V 仅高 1.7pp（80.2% vs 78.5%），代价是独占 3.7M 参数。同时 6-class routing accuracy 下降到 94.8% （vs 3-class 96.8%），因为 6-class 边界更精细，分类更困难，少量 routing error 部分抵消了 expert specialization 的收益。3-class 是 granularity 的 sweet spot。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Rank-48 Parameter-Matched Universal LoRA — Existential Control\",\n    \"description\": \"训练 rank-48 universal LoRA（~11.1M params，精确匹配 Meta-Brain 的 3×rank-16 expert 参数总量）。若 rank-48 ≈ Meta-Brain → Claim 2 崩溃。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"rank48_overall\": 65.1,\n      \"rank48_std\": 1.3,\n      \"rank48_visual\": 67.5,\n      \"rank48_spatial\": 63.2,\n      \"rank48_physical\": 60.8,\n      \"rank48_vs_meta_brain_gap\": 13.8,\n      \"rank48_vs_r16_improvement\": 2.7,\n      \"rank48_gain_over_frozen\": 11.5,\n      \"rank48_gain_per_M\": 0.96,\n      \"claim2_survival\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"全文最关键的单个实验。13.8pp gap + p<0.001 直接证明 routing 的价值不可被 parameter scaling 替代。如果这个 gap <5pp，整篇论文的 thesis 就需要根本性重构。 在 best 档下，gap 足够大且稳健，Claim 2 完整存活。\\n\\n\\nRank-48 universal LoRA 达到 65.1%（+11.5pp over frozen），仅比 rank-16 （62.4%）高 2.7pp，despite 3.2× 参数增长（3.7M → 11.1M）。这证实了 \\\"universal capacity saturation\\\" 假设：uniform LoRA 的收益在 rank 16-48 之间快速递减。根本原因：rank-48 的 11.1M 参数被迫在三种修正方向（visual: early-layer re-projection, spatial: mid-layer trajectory adjustment, physical: late-layer action re-planning）之间共享。这三种修正在 representation space 中 方向不同甚至互斥——改善 visual robustness 的 rank 方向可能削弱 spatial 性能。 增加 rank 只是增加了妥协的参数量，无法解决方向冲突。per-type 分布清晰展示了 这个困境：Visual（67.5%）的 gain over frozen（+16.7pp）远大于 Spatial（+5.7pp） 和 Physical（+4.6pp），因为 visual perturbation 在混合训练数据中占 4/6 sub-types， universal LoRA 被 biased toward visual correction。Meta-Brain 的 3 experts 各自专注一种类型，消除了方向冲突和数据 imbalance。13.8pp gap（p<0.001） 是 Claim 2 的 existential validation：identical parameter budget, dramatically different outcome。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LoRA Rank Sweep (r=16/32/64)\",\n    \"description\": \"在 r=16/32/64 三个 expert rank 上分别训练 Meta-Brain 和 parameter-matched universal LoRA，测试 routing benefit 是否随 expert capacity 增长而变化。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"r16_meta_brain\": 78.9,\n      \"r16_universal_matched\": 65.1,\n      \"r16_routing_benefit\": 13.8,\n      \"r16_total_params_M\": 12,\n      \"r32_meta_brain\": 81.5,\n      \"r32_universal_matched\": 67.6,\n      \"r32_routing_benefit\": 13.9,\n      \"r32_total_params_M\": 24,\n      \"r64_meta_brain\": 84.2,\n      \"r64_universal_matched\": 70.0,\n      \"r64_routing_benefit\": 14.2,\n      \"r64_total_params_M\": 48,\n      \"benefit_trend\": \"monotonically increasing\",\n      \"universal_diminishing_returns_r48_to_r96\": 2.5,\n      \"universal_diminishing_returns_r96_to_r192\": 2.4\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Rank sweep results\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"headers\": [\n            \"Expert Rank\",\n            \"Meta-Brain (%)\",\n            \"Matched Universal (%)\",\n            \"Routing Benefit (pp)\",\n            \"Total Params\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"r=16\",\n              \"78.9\",\n              \"65.1\",\n              \"13.8\",\n              \"12M\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"r=32\",\n              \"81.5\",\n              \"67.6\",\n              \"13.9\",\n              \"24M\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"r=64\",\n              \"84.2\",\n              \"70.0\",\n              \"14.2\",\n              \"48M\"\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Monotonically increasing routing benefit 是一个 clean scaling result。 它也暗示 r=64 Meta-Brain（84.2%）可以 match 或超过 VLA-GSE（81.2%，不同 backbone），虽然 cross-backbone 对比是 indirect，但趋势线的 extrapolation 支持 Meta-Brain 在更高 capacity 下的 competitive potential。\\n\\n\\nRouting benefit 单调递增（13.8→13.9→14.2pp），排除了 Dream worst-case \\\"routing benefit 仅在特定 capacity 下出现\\\" 的顾虑。递增的机制： (1) 更高 rank 的 expert 能捕获更精细的 type-specific correction（r=64 LoRA-V on visual ~86%），这些精细修正的价值在 universal setting 下被 dilute 掉—— universal 必须在三种修正之间分配每一个 rank component。 (2) Universal LoRA 的 scaling 呈递减：r48→r96 仅 +2.5pp, r96→r192 仅 +2.4pp， 因为额外 rank 被用于 refine 已有的妥协方案，而非学习新的修正维度。 (3) Meta-Brain 的 scaling 近似线性（78.9→81.5→84.2，每次 ~+2.6pp）， 因为每个 expert 的额外 rank 直接用于 deepen 该类型的专有修正，没有 cross-type interference。两条 scaling curve 的斜率差导致 benefit gap 缓慢扩大。 这个 finding 的叙事意义：routing benefit 不是特定 capacity 的 artifact， 而是 fundamental architectural advantage——无论参数预算大小，routing 始终优于 uniform correction。如果有更多参数预算，应投入到更高 rank 的 routed experts。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Clean LIBERO Evaluation\",\n    \"description\": \"在标准（无扰动）LIBERO 上评估 Meta-Brain 和 baselines，验证 routing 不会 降低 nominal performance。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"frozen_pi0_clean\": 91.2,\n      \"universal_r16_clean\": 90.8,\n      \"universal_r48_clean\": 90.5,\n      \"meta_brain_clean\": 91.5,\n      \"clean_delta_meta_brain\": 0.3,\n      \"clean_delta_r16\": -0.4,\n      \"clean_delta_r48\": -0.7,\n      \"par_routing_entropy_on_clean\": 0.85,\n      \"par_routing_weight_distribution_clean\": \"≈ 0.34/0.33/0.33\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Clean LIBERO preservation\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"headers\": [\n            \"Method\",\n            \"Clean LIBERO (%)\",\n            \"Δ vs Frozen (pp)\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"Frozen pi0\",\n              \"91.2\",\n              \"—\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Universal r16\",\n              \"90.8\",\n              \"-0.4\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Universal r48\",\n              \"90.5\",\n              \"-0.7\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Meta-Brain\",\n              \"91.5\",\n              \"+0.3\"\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Clean LIBERO preservation 是 practical deployment argument 的关键证据。 Meta-Brain 是唯一在 perturbed 和 clean 条件下都不降级的方法。PAR routing 的 high-entropy fallback 是一个 emergent property（非刻意设计），可作为 \\\"routing 自动 detect perturbation absence\\\" 的附加 insight 呈现。\\n\\n\\nMeta-Brain 在 clean LIBERO 上 91.5%（Δ=+0.3pp vs frozen），完全保持 nominal 性能。这得益于 PAR router 的一个 emergent 行为：在无扰动输入下，layer 6 first-token 激活不匹配任何已知扰动 pattern，PAR 输出高 entropy（0.85， 接近 max log(3)=1.10），routing weights 近似均匀（~0.33/0.33/0.33）。 三个 expert 的修正在 clean input 上大致方向相反（各自 tuned 为不同扰动的 correction），均匀加权后 net correction ≈ 0——routing 自动 degrade to identity。微弱的 +0.3pp 正 delta 可能来自 expert LoRA 的轻微 regularization 效果。对比 Universal LoRA：r16 下降 0.4pp, r48 下降 0.7pp，因为 universal LoRA 始终应用 correction（无 \\\"关闭\\\" 机制），对 clean input 造成不必要的 representation perturbation。Rank 越高干扰越大（r48 的 -0.7pp），因为 higher-rank LoRA 的 representation 修改幅度更大。这为 deployment 增加了 重要论据：Meta-Brain 的 routing 机制在正常条件下安全 graceful degrade， 而 always-on universal correction 有代价。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cross-Backbone Validation (SmolVLA)\",\n    \"description\": \"在 SmolVLA 上复现 Phase 0 + Phase 1 核心 pipeline，验证 perturbation-diagnostic routing 的跨架构泛化性。P2 优先级。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"smolvla_phase0_3class_f1\": 0.971,\n      \"smolvla_phase0_best_layer\": 4,\n      \"smolvla_frozen_libero_plus\": 49.8,\n      \"smolvla_universal_r16\": 58.2,\n      \"smolvla_meta_brain\": 72.4,\n      \"smolvla_gain_over_frozen\": 22.6,\n      \"smolvla_routing_benefit_vs_universal\": 14.2,\n      \"smolvla_routing_accuracy\": 94.5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Cross-backbone comparison\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"headers\": [\n            \"Metric\",\n            \"pi0 (PaliGemma)\",\n            \"SmolVLA\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"Phase 0 3-class F1\",\n              \"0.993\",\n              \"0.971\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Best probing layer\",\n              \"6 / 18\",\n              \"4 / 12\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Frozen baseline (%)\",\n              \"53.6\",\n              \"49.8\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Universal r16 (%)\",\n              \"62.4\",\n              \"58.2\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Meta-Brain (%)\",\n              \"78.9\",\n              \"72.4\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Routing benefit (pp)\",\n              \"13.8\",\n              \"14.2\"\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Cross-backbone validation 将 contribution 从 \\\"pi0 上有效的 technique\\\" 提升为 \\\"VLA 的通用 robustness principle\\\"。routing benefit 在两个 backbone 上的 高度一致性（13.8 vs 14.2pp）是最有说服力的 generalization evidence。 直接回应 Reviewer C3。\\n\\n\\nSmolVLA Phase 0 F1=0.971（vs pi0 0.993），略低但仍极高，验证了 perturbation diagnosability 不是 PaliGemma 架构的特有属性。Best layer 是 layer 4 （SmolVLA 共 ~12 层），深度比例 ~1/3 与 pi0 的 layer 6/18 一致， 暗示 perturbation information 在 VLA 中的 consolidation 发生在相对一致的 depth fraction。Phase 0 F1 略低的原因：SmolVLA 的 representation 维度更小， perturbation cluster 间的 margin 更窄，但仍足以支撑高质量 routing。 Meta-Brain on SmolVLA 达到 72.4%（+22.6pp over frozen 49.8%）， routing benefit vs universal 为 14.2pp（vs pi0 上的 13.8pp），定量吻合度很高。 SmolVLA 绝对性能低于 pi0（72.4% vs 78.9%）因为 backbone capacity 更小， 但 routing benefit 的相对大小几乎相同（14.2 vs 13.8），说明 routing 的价值不依赖于 backbone quality——无论 backbone 强弱， perturbation-type-specific correction 都比 uniform correction 更高效。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LoRA Layer Placement Ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"对比不同 PaliGemma 层覆盖范围（early 2-6, mid 6-12, late 12-16, all 2-16） 对各 expert type 的影响。P2 优先级。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"lora_v_early\": 78.5,\n      \"lora_v_mid\": 76.2,\n      \"lora_v_late\": 72.8,\n      \"lora_v_all\": 80.2,\n      \"lora_s_early\": 73.5,\n      \"lora_s_mid\": 76.8,\n      \"lora_s_late\": 74.2,\n      \"lora_s_all\": 77.5,\n      \"lora_p_early\": 69.8,\n      \"lora_p_mid\": 72.5,\n      \"lora_p_late\": 74.5,\n      \"lora_p_all\": 74.8,\n      \"v_best_subset\": \"early (2-6)\",\n      \"s_best_subset\": \"mid (6-12)\",\n      \"p_best_subset\": \"late (12-16)\",\n      \"v_all_minus_best_subset\": 1.7,\n      \"s_all_minus_best_subset\": 0.7,\n      \"p_all_minus_best_subset\": 0.3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Layer placement ablation\",\n        \"data\": {\n          \"headers\": [\n            \"Layers\",\n            \"LoRA-V Visual (%)\",\n            \"LoRA-S Spatial (%)\",\n            \"LoRA-P Physical (%)\"\n          ],\n          \"rows\": [\n            [\n              \"Early (2-6)\",\n              \"78.5 ★V\",\n              \"73.5\",\n              \"69.8\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Mid (6-12)\",\n              \"76.2\",\n              \"76.8 ★S\",\n              \"72.5\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"Late (12-16)\",\n              \"72.8\",\n              \"74.2\",\n              \"74.5 ★P\"\n            ],\n            [\n              \"All (2-16)\",\n              \"80.2\",\n              \"77.5\",\n              \"74.8\"\n            ]\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"V→early, S→mid, P→late 的对应关系提供了 mechanistic insight，支撑 \\\"不同扰动 影响不同处理阶段\\\" 的理论框架。这个 finding 虽然不影响主要 claim（all-layer 仍是实用最优），但作为 practical insight 增加了论文的理论深度。未来工作可 探索 layer-specific routing（根据扰动类型动态选择 active layers）。\\n\\nLayer placement 揭示了清晰的 V→early, S→mid, P→late 偏好梯度： LoRA-V 在 early layers 最优 subset（78.5%），因为视觉扰动（camera/light/ background/noise）破坏 early visual representation——在损坏发生处修正最高效。 Late layers（72.8%）最差（-7.4pp vs all），因为 corrupted features 已经 propagate 到深层并 compound，late-layer 修正无法 undo upstream corruption。 LoRA-S 在 mid layers 最优（76.8%），因为 spatial perturbation（layout 变化） 影响的是 visual-to-spatial reasoning 的转换阶段——mid layers 将 2D visual features 转化为 3D spatial-action representations。LoRA-P 在 late layers 最优（74.5%），且与 all-layer（74.8%）仅差 0.3pp，因为 physical perturbation （robot 初始状态变化）影响 high-level action planning，这发生在 late decision layers。但所有 expert 在 all-layer 覆盖下均为最优或接近最优，说明 cross-layer redundancy 有益——即使存在层偏好，拥有 all-layer coverage 可以 catch residual perturbation effects at other layers。v_all_minus_best_subset 最大（1.7pp）， 说明 visual perturbation 虽集中在 early layers 但 mid/late 仍有 residual impact。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":856,"startLine":1,"totalLines":856}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B1Q5UcqU9vzBES84m9JkGJ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — meta_brain_lora_routing\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: CoRL 2026 (Austin, Nov 9-12)\n5\t- Abstract DDL: 2026-05-26\n6\t- Paper DDL: 2026-05-29\n7\t\n8\t## Core Insight\n9\t\n10\tVLA internal representations already encode rich perturbation-type-specific information (Phase 0: single-layer F1=1.0 at K=1), yet existing robustness methods either ignore this diagnostic signal entirely (VLA-GSE, RobustVLA) or only use it for detection without correction (SAFE). Meta-Brain closes the loop: diagnose perturbation type from frozen activations, then route to a type-specialized LoRA expert for targeted correction — achieving the \"right fix for the right failure\" at ~10x fewer parameters than perturbation-agnostic capacity routing.\n11\t\n12\t## Core Claims (3)\n13\t\n14\t1. **Perturbation Diagnosability** — Frozen VLA (pi0) internal activations at a single layer and single token (PaliGemma layer 6, first token) encode perturbation type with perfect accuracy (3-class K=1 F1=1.000 with first-token pooling), enabling real-time, zero-overhead perturbation diagnosis from a single forward pass.\n15\t\n16\t2. **Targeted Correction > Uniform Correction** — Perturbation-type-specific LoRA experts (Visual/Spatial/Physical), routed by the diagnosed type, outperform a universal LoRA baseline of equivalent total parameter budget on LIBERO-Plus, demonstrating that routing by perturbation type is a more efficient use of adaptation capacity than uniform correction.\n17\t\n18\t3. **Parameter-Efficient Robustness** — Meta-Brain (~12M trainable params) achieves robustness gains that a parameter-matched universal LoRA (rank 48, ~12M) cannot replicate, demonstrating that routing by perturbation type is more efficient use of adaptation capacity than uniform correction. Cross-backbone comparison with VLA-GSE (114M on Qwen3-VL-4B) is indirect/suggestive only — primary efficiency metric is within-backbone gain-over-parameter-matched-baseline.\n19\t\n20\t## Story Spine\n21\t\n22\t- **Problem**: VLAs achieve >90% on standard LIBERO but collapse under perturbation (pi0: 53.6% on LIBERO-Plus). Different perturbation types disrupt different processing stages — visual perturbations corrupt early representations, spatial perturbations invalidate action trajectories, physical perturbations break force assumptions. Yet all existing robustness methods apply either single-modality correction or perturbation-agnostic uniform adaptation.\n23\t\n24\t- **Existing approaches & gaps**: VLA-GSE (114M params, 81.2% on LIBERO-Plus) demonstrates routing helps, but routes by per-token capacity needs — the same gating configuration handles camera (64.4%) and layout (82.6%) without perturbation awareness. FTM achieves 90% on visual perturbations with 4K params but cannot handle spatial/physical. RobustVLA adds +12.6% via uniform adversarial training. No method combines perturbation diagnosis with type-specific correction.\n25\t\n26\t- **Our framing**: We propose perturbation-diagnostic routing as a new design dimension for VLA robustness, orthogonal to capacity-based routing (VLA-GSE), rank-based adaptation (LoRA-SP), and task-based routing (MoIRA/CORAL). We show that VLA internals already \"know\" what went wrong — they just lack the mechanism to apply the right fix. Meta-Brain adds that mechanism with minimal parameters.\n27\t\n28\t- **Headline result template**: \"On LIBERO-Plus, Meta-Brain achieves X% with ~12M trainable parameters, improving Y% over frozen pi0 baseline and Z% over a parameter-matched rank-48 universal LoRA (~12M), demonstrating that perturbation-diagnostic routing outperforms uniform adaptation at equivalent parameter budget.\"\n29\t\n30\t## Contribution Structure (single system contribution, not 3 independent claims)\n31\t\n32\tOne well-executed systems contribution: Meta-Brain — a modular framework that diagnoses perturbation type from frozen VLA activations and routes to type-specialized LoRA experts. Supporting evidence:\n33\t1. **Empirical finding**: VLA internal representations encode perturbation type at single-layer, single-step granularity (prerequisite observation)\n34\t2. **Architecture + ablation**: PAR router + LoRA bank with comprehensive ablation ladder including parameter-matched controls (rank-48 universal), random routing baseline, and rank scaling analysis\n35\t3. **Practical insight**: Layer placement analysis reveals perturbation-type-to-layer mapping (V→early, S→mid, P→late)\n36\t\n37\tNote: Correction Memory is an optional module — present as ablation footnote, NOT as a named architectural component. Dream reviewers across all tiers viewed CM (+1-2%) as padding.\n38\t\n39\t## Venue Fit (CoRL 2026)\n40\t\n41\t**Strengths**:\n42\t- Pi0 backbone + LIBERO-Plus eval is core CoRL territory\n43\t- Architecture operates on representations (sim evaluation methodologically sufficient)\n44\t- Parameter efficiency matters for real-robot deployment (~12M vs 114M)\n45\t- Single forward pass routing = no latency overhead for real-time control\n46\t\n47\t**Risks**:\n48\t- Sim-only evaluation (mitigated: LIBERO-Plus is CVPR 2026 standard, sim-only is accepted pattern at CoRL for architecture contributions)\n49\t- Single backbone (pi0) — need gain-over-baseline framing to enable contextualized comparison with VLA-GSE (Qwen3-VL-4B)\n50\t- Absolute performance may trail SRPO (82.1%) / CorridorVLA (83.21%) which use full training — frame as parameter-efficient approach, not absolute SOTA chase\n51\t\n52\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n53\t\n54\t### C1: \"Phase 0 classification is too easy — trivially solvable routing\"\n55\t**Risk**: High Phase 0 accuracy (F1=0.993) may suggest the task is trivial and routing adds no value.\n56\t**Response**: Easy diagnosis ≠ easy correction. The value of routing is in Phase 1 (specialized vs universal LoRA), not Phase 0. Easy routing is actually desirable — it means the router adds zero overhead concern. Ablation exp-005 directly tests whether routing matters.\n57\t\n58\t### C2: \"Sim-only evaluation, no real robot\"\n59\t**Risk**: CoRL values real-world experiments.\n60\t**Response**: LIBERO-Plus is the standard robustness benchmark (CVPR 2026). Meta-Brain operates on representations, not hardware-specific signals. Sim-only is the established evaluation pattern for VLA architecture contributions at CoRL (SAFE, VLA-GSE, RobustVLA all sim-only on LIBERO variants).\n61\t\n62\t### C3: \"Single backbone (pi0), limited generalizability\"\n63\t**Risk**: Results may be specific to pi0's PaliGemma architecture.\n64\t**Response**: (a) Phase 0 finding (perturbation classifiability) is grounded in mechanistic evidence across multiple VLAs (SAFE on OpenVLA, probing on OpenVLA, feature steering on pi0.5 + OpenVLA). (b) Tier 3 cross-backbone experiment on SmolVLA/OpenVLA if time permits. (c) Gain-over-baseline metric enables fair comparison across backbones.\n65\t\n66\t### C4: \"Parameter budget comparison unfair — different backbone from VLA-GSE\"\n67\t**Risk**: Comparing 6M (on pi0) vs 114M (on Qwen3-VL-4B) is apples-to-oranges.\n68\t**Response**: Compare gain-over-respective-LoRA-baseline: VLA-GSE gains +12.0% over LoRA (69.2% → 81.2%); Meta-Brain should gain X% over universal LoRA on pi0. Parameter efficiency = gain per trainable parameter. Also report absolute numbers with caveat.\n69\t\n70\t### C5: \"3-class taxonomy may be too coarse\"\n71\t**Risk**: Lumping camera+light+background+noise into \"Visual\" may lose useful distinctions.\n72\t**Response**: Phase 0 6-class analysis shows intra-Visual perturbations are more similar to each other than to Spatial/Physical. 3-class matches the mechanistic distinction in VLA processing (early/mid/late layers). Ablation: 6-class routing vs 3-class routing comparison.\n73\t\n74\t### C6: \"Correction Memory adds complexity for marginal gain\"\n75\t**Risk**: CM may seem over-engineered for routing-weight modulation.\n76\t**Response**: CM is presented as an optional module. Ablation (with/without CM) quantifies its contribution. CM adds only 1 learned parameter (alpha) + CPU-bound FAISS.\n77\t\n78\t### C7: \"Unseen perturbation types at deployment — open-set robustness\"\n79\t**Risk**: 3-class taxonomy is fixed. Novel perturbation types (weather, sensor degradation) will be force-classified to nearest known type, potentially routing to wrong expert.\n80\t**Response**: (a) PAR outputs a probability distribution — low-confidence predictions (high entropy) can trigger fallback to universal LoRA or no correction, providing a natural open-set rejection mechanism. (b) The 3-class taxonomy covers the major perturbation axes in robotic manipulation; truly novel perturbations are an explicit limitation we acknowledge. (c) Correction Memory provides partial adaptation — retrieved exemplars from similar but not identical perturbations can modulate routing appropriately.\n81\t\n82\t### C8: \"Training-deployment feature dimension mismatch\"\n83\t**Risk**: Phase 0 classifier trained on episode-averaged activations (~44 steps) but router uses single-step (K=1) features.\n84\t**Response**: K=1 few-shot analysis directly validates this: F1=0.898 overall, layer 6 K=1=1.0. Paper must explicitly state: (a) classifier is trained on episode-averaged features for label efficiency, (b) deployed router uses single-step features, (c) K=1 validation bridges this gap. Phase 1 PAR router will be trained directly on single-step features to eliminate any residual gap.\n85\t\n86\t## Baselines & Comparisons\n87\t\n88\t| Method | Type | Params | Expected Comparison |\n89\t|--------|------|--------|-------------------|\n90\t| Frozen pi0 | Lower bound | 0 | Our improvement over this = headline number |\n91\t| Universal LoRA (rank 16) | Ablation | ~3.7M | Same per-expert capacity, no routing — tests Claim 2 |\n92\t| Meta-Brain (PAR + ALB) | Ours | ~12M | Full system (3x3.7M experts + 0.5M router) |\n93\t| Meta-Brain + CM | Ours (full) | ~12M + 1 | With Correction Memory |\n94\t| Random routing | Ensemble control | ~12M | Random expert assignment — tests if routing matters vs ensemble effect |\n95\t| Oracle routing | Upper bound | ~12M | Perfect routing — gap to Meta-Brain = routing quality |\n96\t| FTM/FLA | Visual-only | 4K-4.7M | Strong on visual, cannot do spatial/physical |\n97\t| VLA-GSE | Capacity routing | 114M | Different backbone (Qwen3-VL-4B), compare gain-over-LoRA |\n98\t| RobustVLA | Adversarial training | Full model | Uniform approach, compare robustness gain |\n99\t\n100\t## Key Figures (Planned)\n101\t\n102\t1. **Architecture diagram**: Frozen pi0 → PAR (layer 6) → soft routing → LoRA-V/S/P bank → corrected output\n103\t2. **Phase 0 evidence**: t-SNE of layer 6 activations colored by perturbation type + confusion matrix\n104\t3. **Main result table**: LIBERO-Plus per-perturbation breakdown (7 categories × methods)\n105\t4. **Ablation ladder**: Bar chart — Frozen → Universal LoRA → Random Routing → Meta-Brain → Oracle\n106\t5. **Parameter efficiency**: Scatter plot — gain-over-baseline vs trainable parameters (Meta-Brain vs VLA-GSE vs FTM vs RobustVLA)\n107\t6. **Routing analysis**: Heatmap of PAR soft routing weights per perturbation type (should be near-diagonal)\n108\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5fb04169-24f8-4cc8-b045-fda2fee10af8","uuid":"b8373d1d-c3f7-4ccc-b081-1a67055ea920","timestamp":"2026-05-15T17:56:33.583Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515/projects/meta_brain_lora_routing/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T165902/best/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — meta_brain_lora_routing\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: CoRL 2026 (Austin, Nov 9-12)\n- Abstract DDL: 2026-05-26\n- Paper DDL: 2026-05-29\n\n## Core Insight\n\nVLA internal representations already encode rich perturbation-type-specific information (Phase 0: single-layer F1=1.0 at K=1), yet existing robustness methods either ignore this diagnostic signal entirely (VLA-GSE, RobustVLA) or only use it for detection without correction (SAFE). Meta-Brain closes the loop: diagnose perturbation type from frozen activations, then route to a type-specialized LoRA expert for targeted correction — achieving the \"right fix for the right failure\" at ~10x fewer parameters than perturbation-agnostic capacity routing.\n\n## Core Claims (3)\n\n1. **Perturbation Diagnosability** — Frozen VLA (pi0) internal activations at a single layer and single token (PaliGemma layer 6, first token) encode perturbation type with perfect accuracy (3-class K=1 F1=1.000 with first-token pooling), enabling real-time, zero-overhead perturbation diagnosis from a single forward pass.\n\n2. **Targeted Correction > Uniform Correction** — Perturbation-type-specific LoRA experts (Visual/Spatial/Physical), routed by the diagnosed type, outperform a universal LoRA baseline of equivalent total parameter budget on LIBERO-Plus, demonstrating that routing by perturbation type is a more efficient use of adaptation capacity than uniform correction.\n\n3. **Parameter-Efficient Robustness** — Meta-Brain (~12M trainable params) achieves robustness gains that a parameter-matched universal LoRA (rank 48, ~12M) cannot replicate, demonstrating that routing by perturbation type is more efficient use of adaptation capacity than uniform correction. Cross-backbone comparison with VLA-GSE (114M on Qwen3-VL-4B) is indirect/suggestive only — primary efficiency metric is within-backbone gain-over-parameter-matched-baseline.\n\n## Story Spine\n\n- **Problem**: VLAs achieve >90% on standard LIBERO but collapse under perturbation (pi0: 53.6% on LIBERO-Plus). Different perturbation types disrupt different processing stages — visual perturbations corrupt early representations, spatial perturbations invalidate action trajectories, physical perturbations break force assumptions. Yet all existing robustness methods apply either single-modality correction or perturbation-agnostic uniform adaptation.\n\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: VLA-GSE (114M params, 81.2% on LIBERO-Plus) demonstrates routing helps, but routes by per-token capacity needs — the same gating configuration handles camera (64.4%) and layout (82.6%) without perturbation awareness. FTM achieves 90% on visual perturbations with 4K params but cannot handle spatial/physical. RobustVLA adds +12.6% via uniform adversarial training. No method combines perturbation diagnosis with type-specific correction.\n\n- **Our framing**: We propose perturbation-diagnostic routing as a new design dimension for VLA robustness, orthogonal to capacity-based routing (VLA-GSE), rank-based adaptation (LoRA-SP), and task-based routing (MoIRA/CORAL). We show that VLA internals already \"know\" what went wrong — they just lack the mechanism to apply the right fix. Meta-Brain adds that mechanism with minimal parameters.\n\n- **Headline result template**: \"On LIBERO-Plus, Meta-Brain achieves X% with ~12M trainable parameters, improving Y% over frozen pi0 baseline and Z% over a parameter-matched rank-48 universal LoRA (~12M), demonstrating that perturbation-diagnostic routing outperforms uniform adaptation at equivalent parameter budget.\"\n\n## Contribution Structure (single system contribution, not 3 independent claims)\n\nOne well-executed systems contribution: Meta-Brain — a modular framework that diagnoses perturbation type from frozen VLA activations and routes to type-specialized LoRA experts. Supporting evidence:\n1. **Empirical finding**: VLA internal representations encode perturbation type at single-layer, single-step granularity (prerequisite observation)\n2. **Architecture + ablation**: PAR router + LoRA bank with comprehensive ablation ladder including parameter-matched controls (rank-48 universal), random routing baseline, and rank scaling analysis\n3. **Practical insight**: Layer placement analysis reveals perturbation-type-to-layer mapping (V→early, S→mid, P→late)\n\nNote: Correction Memory is an optional module — present as ablation footnote, NOT as a named architectural component. Dream reviewers across all tiers viewed CM (+1-2%) as padding.\n\n## Venue Fit (CoRL 2026)\n\n**Strengths**:\n- Pi0 backbone + LIBERO-Plus eval is core CoRL territory\n- Architecture operates on representations (sim evaluation methodologically sufficient)\n- Parameter efficiency matters for real-robot deployment (~12M vs 114M)\n- Single forward pass routing = no latency overhead for real-time control\n\n**Risks**:\n- Sim-only evaluation (mitigated: LIBERO-Plus is CVPR 2026 standard, sim-only is accepted pattern at CoRL for architecture contributions)\n- Single backbone (pi0) — need gain-over-baseline framing to enable contextualized comparison with VLA-GSE (Qwen3-VL-4B)\n- Absolute performance may trail SRPO (82.1%) / CorridorVLA (83.21%) which use full training — frame as parameter-efficient approach, not absolute SOTA chase\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n\n### C1: \"Phase 0 classification is too easy — trivially solvable routing\"\n**Risk**: High Phase 0 accuracy (F1=0.993) may suggest the task is trivial and routing adds no value.\n**Response**: Easy diagnosis ≠ easy correction. The value of routing is in Phase 1 (specialized vs universal LoRA), not Phase 0. Easy routing is actually desirable — it means the router adds zero overhead concern. Ablation exp-005 directly tests whether routing matters.\n\n### C2: \"Sim-only evaluation, no real robot\"\n**Risk**: CoRL values real-world experiments.\n**Response**: LIBERO-Plus is the standard robustness benchmark (CVPR 2026). Meta-Brain operates on representations, not hardware-specific signals. Sim-only is the established evaluation pattern for VLA architecture contributions at CoRL (SAFE, VLA-GSE, RobustVLA all sim-only on LIBERO variants).\n\n### C3: \"Single backbone (pi0), limited generalizability\"\n**Risk**: Results may be specific to pi0's PaliGemma architecture.\n**Response**: (a) Phase 0 finding (perturbation classifiability) is grounded in mechanistic evidence across multiple VLAs (SAFE on OpenVLA, probing on OpenVLA, feature steering on pi0.5 + OpenVLA). (b) Tier 3 cross-backbone experiment on SmolVLA/OpenVLA if time permits. (c) Gain-over-baseline metric enables fair comparison across backbones.\n\n### C4: \"Parameter budget comparison unfair — different backbone from VLA-GSE\"\n**Risk**: Comparing 6M (on pi0) vs 114M (on Qwen3-VL-4B) is apples-to-oranges.\n**Response**: Compare gain-over-respective-LoRA-baseline: VLA-GSE gains +12.0% over LoRA (69.2% → 81.2%); Meta-Brain should gain X% over universal LoRA on pi0. Parameter efficiency = gain per trainable parameter. Also report absolute numbers with caveat.\n\n### C5: \"3-class taxonomy may be too coarse\"\n**Risk**: Lumping camera+light+background+noise into \"Visual\" may lose useful distinctions.\n**Response**: Phase 0 6-class analysis shows intra-Visual perturbations are more similar to each other than to Spatial/Physical. 3-class matches the mechanistic distinction in VLA processing (early/mid/late layers). Ablation: 6-class routing vs 3-class routing comparison.\n\n### C6: \"Correction Memory adds complexity for marginal gain\"\n**Risk**: CM may seem over-engineered for routing-weight modulation.\n**Response**: CM is presented as an optional module. Ablation (with/without CM) quantifies its contribution. CM adds only 1 learned parameter (alpha) + CPU-bound FAISS.\n\n### C7: \"Unseen perturbation types at deployment — open-set robustness\"\n**Risk**: 3-class taxonomy is fixed. Novel perturbation types (weather, sensor degradation) will be force-classified to nearest known type, potentially routing to wrong expert.\n**Response**: (a) PAR outputs a probability distribution — low-confidence predictions (high entropy) can trigger fallback to universal LoRA or no correction, providing a natural open-set rejection mechanism. (b) The 3-class taxonomy covers the major perturbation axes in robotic manipulation; truly novel perturbations are an explicit limitation we acknowledge. (c) Correction Memory provides partial adaptation — retrieved exemplars from similar but not identical perturbations can modulate routing appropriately.\n\n### C8: \"Training-deployment feature dimension mismatch\"\n**Risk**: Phase 0 classifier trained on episode-averaged activations (~44 steps) but router uses single-step (K=1) features.\n**Response**: K=1 few-shot analysis directly validates this: F1=0.898 overall, layer 6 K=1=1.0. Paper must explicitly state: (a) classifier is trained on episode-averaged features for label efficiency, (b) deployed router uses single-step features, (c) K=1 validation bridges this gap. Phase 1 PAR router will be trained directly on single-step features to eliminate any residual gap.\n\n## Baselines & Comparisons\n\n| Method | Type | Params | Expected Comparison |\n|--------|------|--------|-------------------|\n| Frozen pi0 | Lower bound | 0 | Our improvement over this = headline number |\n| Universal LoRA (rank 16) | Ablation | ~3.7M | Same per-expert capacity, no routing — tests Claim 2 |\n| Meta-Brain (PAR + ALB) | Ours | ~12M | Full system (3x3.7M experts + 0.5M router) |\n| Meta-Brain + CM | Ours (full) | ~12M + 1 | With Correction Memory |\n| Random routing | Ensemble control | ~12M | Random expert assignment — tests if routing matters vs ensemble effect |\n| Oracle routing | Upper bound | ~12M | Perfect routing — gap to Meta-Brain = routing quality |\n| FTM/FLA | Visual-only | 4K-4.7M | Strong on visual, cannot do spatial/physical |\n| VLA-GSE | Capacity routing | 114M | Different backbone (Qwen3-VL-4B), compare gain-over-LoRA |\n| RobustVLA | Adversarial training | Full model | Uniform approach, compare robustness gain |\n\n## Key Figures (Planned)\n\n1. **Architecture diagram**: Frozen pi0 → PAR (layer 6) → soft routing → LoRA-V/S/P bank → corrected output\n2. **Phase 0 evidence**: t-SNE of layer 6 activations colored by perturbation type + confusion matrix\n3. **Main result table**: LIBERO-Plus per-perturbation breakdown (7 categories × methods)\n4. **Ablation ladder**: Bar chart — Frozen → Universal LoRA → Random Routing → Meta-Brain → Oracle\n5. **Parameter efficiency**: Scatter plot — gain-over-baseline vs trainable parameters (Meta-Brain vs VLA-GSE vs FTM vs RobustVLA)\n6. **Routing analysis**: Heatmap of PAR soft routing weights per perturbation type (should be near-diagonal)\n","numLines":108,"startLine":1,"totalLines":108}}}
